Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.88,0:00:57.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢坐飞机 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不太喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.42,0:01:08.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,想知道长途飞行的健身之道吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在到达目的地之後 把鞋和袜子脱掉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.26,0:01:15.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然後光着脚在地毯上走走 把脚趾蜷起来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把脚趾蜷起来?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.77,0:01:23.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 听起来很怪 相信我 我已经做了九年了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.01,0:01:27.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 先生 比洗澡和喝咖啡更有效
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.39,0:01:41.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕 我是警察
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.29,0:01:47.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 我已经作了十一年了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.40,0:01:52.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我代表机长和工作人员欢迎 你们来洛杉矶
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.40,0:01:55.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,祝大家圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.67,0:02:02.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,《虎胆龙威》
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:07.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,247航班的旅客请到14号登机口登机
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.52,0:02:14.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,247航班的旅客请到14号登机口登机
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士先生们
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.82,0:02:47.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士先生们
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.22,0:02:51.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要祝贺你们大家 你们的努力
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.73,0:02:54.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,使今年成为 中富公司历史上业绩最好的一年
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.00,0:03:03.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我代表首席执行长和公司董事会
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.37,0:03:07.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢大家 祝你们圣诞快乐 新年快乐
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.64,0:03:11.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐 新年快乐
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.81,0:03:15.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 荷莉 一起吃晚餐好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.42,0:03:17.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈里 今天是圣诞夜
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,家人、圣诞树…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.26,0:03:24.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有烤栗子?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.49,0:03:28.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,驯鹿和雪人 你怎么不想想这些?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.63,0:03:33.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 我想的是芬芳美酒 和美味奶酪
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.63,0:03:37.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有熊熊的炉火 你明白我的意思吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.07,0:03:43.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,吉妮 已经5:40了 去参加派对 喝点香槟吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.51,0:03:46.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我觉得自己在压榨属下
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.25,0:03:49.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢 你想胎儿会让我喝两杯吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.02,0:03:53.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开酒馆都没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.69,0:03:54.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,最後的机会
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连家 我是露茜·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.53,0:04:09.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 露茜·麦克连 和你说话的是妈妈
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.07,0:04:13.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪!你什么时候回家?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.11,0:04:17.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很快 不过到时候 你肯定已经睡了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.15,0:04:19.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让鲍琳娜和我通话 好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.75,0:04:24.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要在家里转来转去找礼物哦
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸和你一起回家吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.82,0:04:30.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我看还是…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让圣诞老人和妈妈来决定吧
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,叫鲍琳娜来 再见 宝贝
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍琳娜
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.24,0:04:44.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 荷莉太太
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.21,0:04:47.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 麦克连先生来过电话吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 荷莉太太 没有电话
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他上飞机前没时间打
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好还是把客房收拾好
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.92,0:04:57.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是 荷莉太太 我已经收拾了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.06,0:05:04.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你我可怎么办 鲍琳娜?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,加州
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是约翰·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.07,0:05:48.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是阿盖 你的包车司机
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.87,0:05:53.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的熊
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.61,0:06:01.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 阿盖 我们现在该干什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.65,0:06:06.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你知道呢 我是第一次开这种车
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.52,0:06:09.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 这也是我第一次坐这种车
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.82,0:06:12.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松 这里要什么有什么
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.53,0:06:15.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这儿…CD、收音机、电视
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,电话、小酒吧、录影机
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.10,0:06:25.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你的朋友要发情 我还能帮他找头母熊
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.07,0:06:28.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 或是说他结婚了? - 他结婚了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.48,0:06:37.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 哦 真对不起 清洁工今天放假 没想到你会坐前排
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你太太住在这儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.55,0:06:41.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多六个月了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你还住在纽约
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.09,0:06:48.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你总是有这么多问题吗 阿盖?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.30,0:06:52.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我以前开出租车 总喜欢和别人聊聊
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.03,0:06:56.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你离婚了? - 开你的车吧 伙计
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.40,0:07:00.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 说吧 你离婚了? 还是分居?她打你吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.14,0:07:07.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她有份好工作 现在是事业有成
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她不得不搬到这儿
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.28,0:07:15.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你脑子挺灵的 阿盖 - 那你干嘛不到这来?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.69,0:07:21.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不和她一起来 伙计?怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是纽约警察
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.16,0:07:26.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有一堆纽约人渣要抓
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能拍拍屁股就离开
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.07,0:07:31.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说 你觉得她在这儿不会成功
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.41,0:07:35.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她会回去你身边 那就不用收拾行李了 对吧?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你的脑子确实很灵 阿盖
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听听音乐可以吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.39,0:07:46.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 真不错
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听听圣诞歌曲好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.93,0:07:53.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是圣诞歌曲
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.62,0:08:25.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下你太太见到你 你们紧紧拥抱
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.33,0:08:28.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,接着音乐响起 从此就幸福生活 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个计划不错
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.97,0:08:35.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这招不管用 你要找个地方住吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.90,0:08:38.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我要找个地方
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.61,0:08:44.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧 我把车开到车库去等着 要是成了 就打电话给我
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.11,0:08:48.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你的包放在前台 要是没成功 我就帮你找家旅馆
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.05,0:08:53.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这人不错 阿盖 - 给小费的时候别忘了就行
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 - 晚上好
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我来找荷莉·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打在那上面就行了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的玩具
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.09,0:09:35.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 上厕所时 还能帮你拉拉链
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,第三十层
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.45,0:10:02.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开派对那层 现在这座楼里就剩他们了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.52,0:10:06.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,乘快速电梯 听到嘈杂声就到了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.33,0:10:07.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.09,0:11:08.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 香槟，先生？ - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.96,0:11:44.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.43,0:11:47.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的加州人
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.98,0:12:03.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我正在找…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 荷莉·吉奈萝? - 对
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,您肯定是约翰·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是青木 那辆车还可以吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.65,0:12:12.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 是您安排的吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是最起码我能做的
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.39,0:12:15.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方真的不错
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.86,0:12:20.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等完工後会更好的 还有几层没有建好
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.39,0:12:24.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉到下面去传真一些文件 她马上就回来
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.27,0:12:26.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这边请 她的办公室就在这儿
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.80,0:12:30.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.31,0:12:35.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚想打个电话 这儿的电话最近
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.84,0:12:38.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是约翰·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉的丈夫
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一位警官
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯负责国际发展部
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,久仰您的大名
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没擦乾净
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.69,0:12:52.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,您想吃点什么吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.49,0:12:55.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,食物?糕点? 掺水的香槟?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不用 谢谢 我不饿
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.20,0:13:00.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是盛大的聚会
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到日本人也过圣诞节
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.37,0:13:09.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们善於变通 珍珠港没有成功 我们就倾销电器
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.28,0:13:16.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 今天是双喜临门 我们今天做成了一笔大买卖
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉是主要的功臣 我正想…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.82,0:13:21.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可要失陪了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.59,0:13:26.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和大家见过面了?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们正在监视他
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开个玩笑
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.81,0:13:40.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她是一名商业天才 非常强硬
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我正希望你有赶上那班飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给他看看那个表
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.55,0:13:48.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等会儿
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.12,0:13:52.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给他看看 你不好意思吗? 这是对她…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.09,0:13:55.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,努力工作的一点奖赏 是劳力士手表
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想以後会见到的
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.16,0:14:01.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿有能梳洗的地方吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.33,0:14:02.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.35,0:14:22.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你得原谅艾利斯 他每年这个时候都很沮丧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.78,0:14:26.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他总是认为自己的天赋最高 明白吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.12,0:14:28.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这种人
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他看上你了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.59,0:14:35.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 我看上了他的私人浴室
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.56,0:14:38.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要住在哪儿?事发突然…
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.73,0:14:41.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还来不及打电话问你
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.57,0:14:44.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,凯皮·罗伯茨退休到了这儿
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.77,0:14:49.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他说我可以去他那儿住 - 凯皮退休了?他住在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拉摩纳
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.95,0:14:52.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是帕摩纳
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,帕摩纳
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.48,0:14:57.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帕摩纳 - 对
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 那样时间都花在车上了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.02,0:15:05.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是简单一点吧 我有一个空房间
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.63,0:15:08.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然它不算大 可是孩子们…
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.40,0:15:11.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意和你在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们愿意吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我也愿意
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.41,0:15:24.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.76,0:15:43.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是不包括我的姓氏在内 嗯?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.73,0:15:46.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许在签支票的时候能想起来
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候开始姓吉奈萝了?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.04,0:15:55.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一家日本公司 他们认为 已婚女人不可靠…
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是结过婚的 荷莉 你嫁给我了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.21,0:16:02.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么又说起这个了? - 我们还没有谈完
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.05,0:16:08.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有了一次机会 必须把握它 - 对 不管是什么结果
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.39,0:16:12.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许它改变了你对婚姻的理解 - 你根本对我的理解不了解…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.63,0:16:16.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全清楚你对婚姻的理解
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.26,0:16:18.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,吉奈萝小姐 我…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.67,0:16:29.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,青木先生正在找你 他想让你为大家说几句
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.44,0:16:30.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.85,0:16:39.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我一会儿就回来
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.53,0:16:52.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是好样的 约翰
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.23,0:16:55.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干的好 真成熟
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.95,0:17:50.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,贾霸夺下篮板 传给沃斯 接着是格林 再传约翰逊
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又传给沃斯
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,砰!两分
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.37,0:17:59.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,行了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.11,0:19:13.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(自底层至29层关闭)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(太平洋电话公司雇员专用)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真傻
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.96,0:21:14.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把脚趾头蜷起来
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.43,0:21:46.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 阿盖?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.03,0:21:48.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的事怎么样了?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.63,0:21:49.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 你在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.96,0:21:52.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在车库享受呢 你和太太说了些什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还没定下来呐
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,阿盖?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.84,0:22:30.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 怎么了?喂!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.55,0:22:41.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道号码 我等着
Dialogue: 1,0:24:13.77,0:24:16.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,保持镇静 没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:24:38.00,0:24:39.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.74,0:24:43.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静
Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.37,0:24:45.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.76,0:25:04.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士先生们
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.83,0:25:07.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士先生们
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.80,0:25:19.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,由於中富公司在全球的 长期贪婪掠夺
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.17,0:25:23.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们将遭到强大力量的惩罚
Dialogue: 1,0:25:24.48,0:25:26.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们将作为见证人
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.88,0:25:29.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在…
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.98,0:25:32.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请问哪位是青木先生?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.49,0:25:38.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约瑟夫·高木
Dialogue: 1,0:25:40.36,0:25:42.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,1937年生於京都
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.40,0:25:44.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别动
Dialogue: 1,0:25:44.76,0:25:48.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全家於1939年 移民至加州的圣佩德罗
Dialogue: 1,0:25:49.90,0:25:54.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,1942年至43年在拘留营度过
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.78,0:25:59.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,1955年获得加州大学的奖学金
Dialogue: 1,0:26:00.01,0:26:01.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,195年
Dialogue: 1,0:26:05.82,0:26:09.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,1962年获史丹福大学法学学位
Dialogue: 1,0:26:10.49,0:26:13.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,1970年哈佛工商管理硕士学位
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.43,0:26:17.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,中富贸易公司总裁
Dialogue: 1,0:26:17.80,0:26:21.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,中富投资集团副主席
Dialogue: 1,0:26:21.20,0:26:22.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,够了
Dialogue: 1,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为人之父
Dialogue: 1,0:26:25.61,0:26:26.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有五个孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.21,0:26:28.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是青木
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.24,0:26:32.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,您好
Dialogue: 1,0:26:32.85,0:26:34.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识您
Dialogue: 1,0:26:47.56,0:26:50.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,32楼还没完工 33楼是电脑室
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.51,0:27:05.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的西装
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.85,0:27:07.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰菲利普 伦敦店
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.32,0:27:12.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己也有两套
Dialogue: 1,0:27:13.05,0:27:16.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,据说阿拉法特也在那儿买衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:27:20.89,0:27:23.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这边吗? - 向左转
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.72,0:27:49.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,“当亚历山大见到他辽阔的帝国时
Dialogue: 1,0:27:49.52,0:27:53.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他哭了 因为他已经无可征服”
Dialogue: 1,0:27:57.93,0:28:00.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是古典教育的好处
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.84,0:28:04.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太美了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.61,0:28:09.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我小的时候也喜欢做模型
Dialogue: 1,0:28:09.38,0:28:14.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,精确无误 不能放过任何细节
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.98,0:28:16.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,太美了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:16.62,0:28:21.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你来的目的? 我们在印尼的计划?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:21.19,0:28:24.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你和同夥们都想错了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:24.16,0:28:27.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想发展那个地区 而不是剥削
Dialogue: 1,0:28:27.36,0:28:31.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全相信 我读过《福布斯》杂志的报导
Dialogue: 1,0:28:34.00,0:28:35.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,青木先生
Dialogue: 1,0:28:37.07,0:28:40.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以谈上一整天 工业化和男性时装
Dialogue: 1,0:28:40.94,0:28:42.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我想工作更重要
Dialogue: 1,0:28:43.04,0:28:46.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同事西奥有些问题要问你
Dialogue: 1,0:28:46.98,0:28:49.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上是要你做几道填空题
Dialogue: 1,0:28:59.39,0:29:01.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有这密码!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:02.23,0:29:05.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们闯进来就是为了电脑?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.97,0:29:09.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得到的任何资讯 明天早上都会被东京方面更改
Dialogue: 1,0:29:09.27,0:29:12.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本无法勒索我方高层 威胁或者敲诈…
Dialogue: 1,0:29:12.27,0:29:14.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:24.22,0:29:28.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,青木先生 我对你的电脑不感兴趣
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.09,0:29:35.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我需要密码
Dialogue: 1,0:29:35.70,0:29:40.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我感兴趣的是你锁在金库里
Dialogue: 1,0:29:40.20,0:29:44.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,价值6.4亿美元的可转让债券
Dialogue: 1,0:29:44.67,0:29:48.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而金库受电脑控制
Dialogue: 1,0:29:49.51,0:29:51.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们只要钱?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.95,0:29:54.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们算什么恐怖分子?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.62,0:30:00.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说我们是恐怖分子?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.57,0:30:22.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这笔债券最多也只有
Dialogue: 1,0:30:22.44,0:30:26.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,您们财团十天的运作资金
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.31,0:30:29.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,小菜一盘
Dialogue: 1,0:30:29.72,0:30:30.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在…
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.15,0:30:36.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请说出密码
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.26,0:30:41.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有密码也没用 金库共有七道安全设施
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.56,0:30:44.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,密码只是其中一道 你永远也打不开
Dialogue: 1,0:30:44.33,0:30:47.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那您就更没有理由 不告诉我们了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:47.73,0:30:51.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不出所料 - 还没完呢
Dialogue: 1,0:30:56.28,0:30:59.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,您的西装很漂亮 青木先生
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.68,0:31:03.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,弄脏了会很可惜
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.12,0:31:08.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会从一数到三
Dialogue: 1,0:31:09.52,0:31:12.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不会有四
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.99,0:31:15.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,说出密码
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.30,0:31:17.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.53,0:31:21.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,二
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 三 - 我说过了 我不知道!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.61,0:31:28.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,坐飞机到东京去问社长吧
Dialogue: 1,0:31:28.94,0:31:30.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 你只能杀了我
Dialogue: 1,0:31:31.18,0:31:31.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看来只好费些力气了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:37.45,0:31:39.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 你来打扫这里
Dialogue: 1,0:31:39.55,0:31:42.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔 你最好到设备层去 检查一下亨利的进展
Dialogue: 1,0:32:08.28,0:32:09.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没人
Dialogue: 1,0:32:10.15,0:32:11.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去找亨利
Dialogue: 1,0:32:13.39,0:32:14.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在…
Dialogue: 1,0:32:15.25,0:32:17.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你能破解密码吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:18.39,0:32:22.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你带我来只是因为我的 相貌英俊吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.03,0:32:32.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,阿盖 希望你听到枪声 正在报警
Dialogue: 1,0:32:32.61,0:32:36.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然会去找你
Dialogue: 1,0:32:36.31,0:32:39.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 我以前骗过你吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:39.25,0:32:41.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老板? 他还以为我去了赌城呢
Dialogue: 1,0:32:43.05,0:32:45.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,尤里 爬到管道上面去
Dialogue: 1,0:32:46.29,0:32:48.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马可 你到对面去
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.26,0:32:51.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我把导线扔给你
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.03,0:32:57.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯 我们在楼顶
Dialogue: 1,0:33:11.04,0:33:12.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,接着
Dialogue: 1,0:33:15.85,0:33:17.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到了 尤里
Dialogue: 1,0:33:24.46,0:33:25.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,破解密码需要三十分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:33:25.93,0:33:31.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五道机械锁则需要 至少两到两个半小时
Dialogue: 1,0:33:31.36,0:33:34.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是第七道锁 我也无法对付
Dialogue: 1,0:33:57.19,0:33:58.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:58.69,0:34:02.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,第七道锁 是电磁密封装置
Dialogue: 1,0:34:02.20,0:34:04.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里面无法切断电路
Dialogue: 1,0:34:06.40,0:34:07.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我
Dialogue: 1,0:34:09.47,0:34:12.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的为什么不阻止他们 约翰?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.61,0:34:16.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这样你也死定了 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:16.54,0:34:18.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静 混蛋 冷静!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:30.92,0:34:32.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,楼内有火警警报
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.23,0:34:34.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打119
Dialogue: 1,0:34:34.99,0:34:38.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们警卫的名字 和消防密码 取消警报
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.10,0:34:40.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然後毁掉火警系统
Dialogue: 1,0:34:43.80,0:34:46.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾迪 警报是哪一层发出的?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.24,0:34:50.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能走了吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:02.96,0:35:04.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,行
Dialogue: 1,0:35:04.39,0:35:07.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 过来 宝贝 到爸爸这来
Dialogue: 1,0:35:11.06,0:35:12.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 哈!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:13.00,0:35:14.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 宝贝 过来 宝贝!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:14.23,0:35:18.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,到爸爸这来 让我亲亲你他妈的小狗
Dialogue: 1,0:35:20.94,0:35:23.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你们这些蠢货
Dialogue: 1,0:35:23.81,0:35:25.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦!不!把车头掉过来
Dialogue: 1,0:35:59.21,0:36:02.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,火警已经解除了 朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:36:06.89,0:36:09.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没人会来帮你的
Dialogue: 1,0:36:13.29,0:36:16.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该出来和大家在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:36:19.20,0:36:21.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证绝不伤害你
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.83,0:36:53.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪 白痴 我是警察
Dialogue: 1,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会伤害我
Dialogue: 1,0:36:55.90,0:36:57.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是吗?为什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:57.77,0:36:59.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是警察
Dialogue: 1,0:36:59.74,0:37:02.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警察要遵守规定
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.24,0:37:05.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我的上司也这么说
Dialogue: 1,0:38:08.43,0:38:10.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(密码有效 一号锁解除)
Dialogue: 1,0:38:10.12,0:38:12.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(继续操作吗?)
Dialogue: 1,0:38:12.41,0:38:14.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大傻瓜 当然继续
Dialogue: 1,0:38:54.89,0:38:56.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界有九百万恐怖分子
Dialogue: 1,0:38:56.96,0:39:00.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我却杀了一个 脚比我妹妹还小的家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:39:49.48,0:39:54.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望这是一次 职业的、有效的、合作性的接触
Dialogue: 1,0:39:54.21,0:39:56.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要问的太多
Dialogue: 1,0:39:56.12,0:39:58.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜 你们的青木先生不这样看
Dialogue: 1,0:39:58.42,0:40:02.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他的余生无法和大家在一起了
Dialogue: 1,0:40:04.22,0:40:06.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,事态的发展是由你们决定的
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.33,0:40:10.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以走出去 也可以被抬出去
Dialogue: 1,0:40:10.30,0:40:14.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要心存幻想 我们是主宰者
Dialogue: 1,0:40:15.83,0:40:19.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在大家来决定吧
Dialogue: 1,0:40:19.91,0:40:21.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请记住…
Dialogue: 1,0:40:23.31,0:40:25.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,任何可能的情况我们都考虑到了
Dialogue: 1,0:40:33.79,0:40:35.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拿回来!
Dialogue: 1,0:40:44.96,0:40:47.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我有一支机关枪
Dialogue: 1,0:40:49.30,0:40:52.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呵 呵 呵
Dialogue: 1,0:40:55.31,0:40:57.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是漏网的警卫?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:57.38,0:41:02.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警卫都是吃养老金的胖老头 不 肯定另有他人
Dialogue: 1,0:41:12.16,0:41:14.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须采取措施 汉斯
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.36,0:41:15.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:41:15.69,0:41:20.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉卡尔 他弟弟死了 叫他下来
Dialogue: 1,0:41:24.17,0:41:27.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,法兰柯 你和佛里把屍体抬到楼上
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.94,0:41:31.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要让人质乱想
Dialogue: 1,0:42:35.04,0:42:36.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要报仇!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:36.88,0:42:39.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,会有机会的! 不过先让亨利装好炸药
Dialogue: 1,0:42:40.05,0:42:42.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,弄开金库 我们报警後
Dialogue: 1,0:42:42.72,0:42:45.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,到时你要把大楼拆了都行
Dialogue: 1,0:42:46.02,0:42:48.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前 我们不能改变计划!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:49.29,0:42:51.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他改变我们的计划呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:56.33,0:42:58.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.20,0:43:02.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有些不对头
Dialogue: 1,0:43:02.40,0:43:03.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警察？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:05.64,0:43:08.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是约翰 - 约翰?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:08.44,0:43:11.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪!他会把一切都搞糟的! 他以为自己在干什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.01,0:43:13.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在工作
Dialogue: 1,0:43:13.35,0:43:17.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,胡闹!他的工作在三千英里之外
Dialogue: 1,0:43:17.08,0:43:21.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有他 我们还有机会离开这个地方
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.45,0:43:23.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去跟青木说吧
Dialogue: 1,0:43:47.36,0:43:49.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,求救!求救! 有人听到的话转到9号频道
Dialogue: 1,0:43:49.80,0:43:53.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怖分子占领了中富大厦 劫持了至少三十名人质
Dialogue: 1,0:43:53.90,0:43:56.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复 恐怖分子人数不详
Dialogue: 1,0:43:56.10,0:43:59.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,六个或更多人 携有自动武器
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.54,0:44:00.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在中富大厦，世纪城
Dialogue: 1,0:44:00.61,0:44:03.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里最适合发送信号?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.58,0:44:04.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,楼顶!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.21,0:44:05.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快!快!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.32,0:44:10.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和刚才的火警来自同一地点
Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.99,0:44:13.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我来应付
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.89,0:44:19.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 不管你是谁 这个频道仅供紧急呼叫使用
Dialogue: 1,0:44:19.33,0:44:22.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是玩笑 小姐! 我听起来像在订比萨吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.38,0:44:38.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我谁也不许杀他
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.78,0:44:40.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经杀了一个人质
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.02,0:44:44.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在巩固阵地 而你却和我在这儿废话!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:44.62,0:44:48.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我已经说过了 这是一个专用频道
Dialogue: 1,0:44:48.39,0:44:52.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有紧急情况 请你打119
Dialogue: 1,0:44:52.19,0:44:55.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我将视此为违法活动
Dialogue: 1,0:44:55.93,0:44:59.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊!举报我! 他妈的快来这儿抓我啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:45:13.41,0:45:16.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,调一辆警车去那儿看看
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.76,0:45:32.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你们只吃甜甜圈
Dialogue: 1,0:45:32.23,0:45:34.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是给我太太买的
Dialogue: 1,0:45:36.17,0:45:38.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她怀孕了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:40.04,0:45:40.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,包起来
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.48,0:45:43.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真会选时间
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.65,0:45:48.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.22,0:45:53.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,中心呼叫林肯30 完毕
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.72,0:45:55.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是林肯30 请讲 完毕
Dialogue: 1,0:45:55.79,0:46:00.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请前往中富大厦 调查非法闯入案件
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.13,0:46:04.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,林肯30呼叫中心 我这就去
Dialogue: 1,0:48:02.32,0:48:03.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.23,0:48:21.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 电梯跑哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.42,0:48:45.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.24,0:49:03.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他在电梯井里
Dialogue: 1,0:49:04.01,0:49:07.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 电梯已经被锁住了 他逃不了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.52,0:49:09.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把他关在里面 然後回来
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.19,0:49:14.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.23,0:49:23.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔 警察可能就要到了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:24.03,0:49:24.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.05,0:49:46.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:49:52.13,0:49:54.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以骗过他们 但不能让他们听见枪声
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.53,0:49:57.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把他关起来 他就无计可施了
Dialogue: 1,0:51:02.06,0:51:05.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,“到西海岸来吧 我们聚聚…”
Dialogue: 1,0:51:12.64,0:51:15.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我才知道鼹鼠的感受
Dialogue: 1,0:52:23.67,0:52:27.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔，警察来了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:12.36,0:53:14.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也该来了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:19.67,0:53:22.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有骚乱的迹象 中心
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.27,0:53:23.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 林肯30 也许是骚扰电话
Dialogue: 1,0:53:23.97,0:53:25.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再检查一遍该地区，确认情形
Dialogue: 1,0:53:32.28,0:53:34.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁在开车 夜魔侠吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大厦里面有警卫
Dialogue: 1,0:53:39.32,0:53:41.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要进去仔细看看
Dialogue: 1,0:53:41.19,0:53:42.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 林肯30 小心进行
Dialogue: 1,0:53:45.79,0:53:46.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾迪
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.26,0:53:49.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我早有预感你会呼叫我
Dialogue: 1,0:54:13.05,0:54:15.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 警官 我能帮什么忙吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:27.07,0:54:28.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一次假警报
Dialogue: 1,0:54:29.07,0:54:33.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是该死的电脑让你又白跑一趟
Dialogue: 1,0:54:33.34,0:54:36.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,自从这套系统安装好以後 它就一直故障
Dialogue: 1,0:54:36.91,0:54:39.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣母大学领先南加州大学
Dialogue: 1,0:54:39.28,0:54:41.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:41.12,0:54:43.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了五十块钱赌他们赢
Dialogue: 1,0:54:45.42,0:54:49.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点 大队人马在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:15.45,0:55:17.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以四处看看吗 老兄?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.65,0:55:19.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,行 随便
Dialogue: 1,0:55:19.12,0:55:24.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在第一节只剩二十七秒钟了
Dialogue: 1,0:55:27.43,0:55:28.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意真硬
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.03,0:55:30.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不准动 混蛋! 放下枪!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:30.73,0:55:31.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.93,0:55:34.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快放下! - 别开枪
Dialogue: 1,0:55:34.80,0:55:35.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的快点放下!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:36.27,0:55:37.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马可 趴下!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.02,0:55:56.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还查什么呀
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.07,0:56:06.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你完蛋了!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:07.00,0:56:10.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有桌子了 你还想藏哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:11.11,0:56:14.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下次有机会开枪时 千万别犹豫
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.82,0:56:23.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你的建议
Dialogue: 1,0:56:24.08,0:56:27.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起打搅了 - 没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.62,0:56:30.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 圣诞快乐 - 也祝你圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 1,0:56:44.54,0:56:46.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看在老天份上…
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.91,0:56:51.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,林肯30呼叫中心
Dialogue: 1,0:56:51.75,0:56:52.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,林肯30 请讲
Dialogue: 1,0:56:52.91,0:56:57.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又白跑一趟 中富大厦一切正常 完毕
Dialogue: 1,0:57:06.16,0:57:07.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.23,0:57:08.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:17.04,0:57:18.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入派对 老兄!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:27.15,0:57:29.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马上派人来 妈的
Dialogue: 1,0:57:29.25,0:57:31.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在中富大厦 遭到自动武器袭击
Dialogue: 1,0:57:31.89,0:57:33.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我请求立即支援!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:35.26,0:57:36.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马上来! 听见没有?马上!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:55.18,0:57:57.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮卡 我会搞定餐馆预约
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.28,0:58:00.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,沃夫冈和我是很好的朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:58:01.38,0:58:03.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我采访过他 保证没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:58:03.12,0:58:04.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.92,0:58:07.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复 有警察需要增援…
Dialogue: 1,0:58:07.69,0:58:11.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在中富大厦! 我的车被打成筛子啦!
Dialogue: 1,0:58:11.43,0:58:15.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要支援 快点来! 他妈的 马上!
Dialogue: 1,0:58:36.38,0:58:38.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到听到警笛这么高兴!
Dialogue: 1,0:58:38.65,0:58:43.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大家不要紧张 只是一点麻烦 没什么
Dialogue: 1,0:58:43.16,0:58:47.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警方的行动是不可避免的 而且是必要的
Dialogue: 1,0:58:48.00,0:58:51.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就让他们在外面瞎撞吧
Dialogue: 1,0:58:51.53,0:58:53.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是一个开始
Dialogue: 1,0:58:54.84,0:58:58.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我已经说过 要保持无线电静默
Dialogue: 1,0:58:58.41,0:59:01.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 我很抱歉 汉斯 我没收到这条指令
Dialogue: 1,0:59:01.18,0:59:04.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该贴在公告板上
Dialogue: 1,0:59:04.61,0:59:07.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想既然我干掉了 托尼、马可和他的朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.21,0:59:10.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你和卡尔还有法兰柯 也许会感到寂寞
Dialogue: 1,0:59:10.15,0:59:12.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想和你聊聊
Dialogue: 1,0:59:12.19,0:59:14.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会知道这么多?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:15.82,0:59:17.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是一个好人
Dialogue: 1,0:59:18.39,0:59:21.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你就是那位不速之客
Dialogue: 1,0:59:22.06,0:59:23.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一名警卫
Dialogue: 1,0:59:23.50,0:59:25.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你可真是称职
Dialogue: 1,0:59:26.50,0:59:28.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 汉斯 你猜错了
Dialogue: 1,0:59:28.64,0:59:31.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要再猜一次 说不准还能得分
Dialogue: 1,0:59:36.51,0:59:38.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这对你的健康没好处
Dialogue: 1,0:59:39.78,0:59:41.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:41.38,0:59:43.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一只讨厌的苍蝇 汉斯
Dialogue: 1,0:59:43.72,0:59:45.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一只捣乱的猴子
Dialogue: 1,0:59:45.22,0:59:47.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喉咙里的一根刺
Dialogue: 1,0:59:52.33,0:59:54.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去查查别的人 别用对讲机
Dialogue: 1,0:59:54.90,0:59:59.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看看马可是不是真的死了 查出还有谁失联
Dialogue: 1,1:00:02.67,1:00:04.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不速之客先生?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:05.87,1:00:07.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:08.34,1:00:10.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我还在
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.08,1:00:12.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你想打开大门迎接我吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:12.91,1:00:14.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我想不会
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.92,1:00:17.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我带来了麻烦
Dialogue: 1,1:00:17.75,1:00:19.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的名字 但是你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:19.62,1:00:23.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是小的时候电影看多了?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:23.89,1:00:27.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还是破产家庭的孤儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:27.13,1:00:30.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,自以为是大英雄? 蓝波?狄龙警长?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:31.53,1:00:34.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我一直崇拜牛仔罗伊
Dialogue: 1,1:00:35.10,1:00:36.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是那件亮闪闪的上衣
Dialogue: 1,1:00:36.94,1:00:40.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的以为 能和我们对抗吗 牛仔?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:43.31,1:00:45.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧 混蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:00:49.42,1:00:51.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一部新闻车 我能胜过其他人!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.59,1:00:53.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我还没拿到新闻稿
Dialogue: 1,1:00:53.49,1:00:55.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维 保持镇静 好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:55.79,1:00:57.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我求你了
Dialogue: 1,1:00:57.66,1:01:00.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西蒙已经乘新闻车出去了 我让他先去看看
Dialogue: 1,1:01:00.96,1:01:02.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让给西蒙!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:02.86,1:01:05.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的新闻 我马上就要去!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:05.73,1:01:07.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 听着 山姆 我告诉你
Dialogue: 1,1:01:07.47,1:01:09.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不给我一辆车 我就去偷一辆
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.74,1:01:12.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 少说两句 索伯 - 闭嘴 哈维!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:12.27,1:01:14.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,四 三 二…
Dialogue: 1,1:01:14.91,1:01:16.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一
Dialogue: 1,1:01:16.34,1:01:18.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维 已经开始直播了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:22.38,1:01:24.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 我是哈维·强森
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.35,1:01:30.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是盖儿·华伦斯 现在是十点
Dialogue: 1,1:01:30.22,1:01:33.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,新闻节目 首先播报要闻
Dialogue: 1,1:01:33.13,1:01:36.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给你五号车 赶快滚蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:01:44.10,1:01:47.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他没骗人 马可躺在大街上
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.57,1:01:49.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个是亨利
Dialogue: 1,1:01:49.94,1:01:52.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他的包不见了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.98,1:01:56.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,雷管在他那儿
Dialogue: 1,1:02:00.39,1:02:01.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西奥
Dialogue: 1,1:02:02.06,1:02:03.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西奥
Dialogue: 1,1:02:04.79,1:02:07.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了 你的进展如何?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:08.56,1:02:10.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开了三道 还有四道
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.20,1:02:11.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那就别浪费时间和我说话
Dialogue: 1,1:02:11.60,1:02:13.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是洛杉矶警察局的鲍尔警官
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.10,1:02:15.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果那个报警的人
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.80,1:02:18.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,能收到这个频道
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.01,1:02:22.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你马上回话
Dialogue: 1,1:02:22.38,1:02:23.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我再说一遍
Dialogue: 1,1:02:23.48,1:02:26.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果刚才报警的人能收到这个频道
Dialogue: 1,1:02:26.88,1:02:29.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你马上回话
Dialogue: 1,1:02:33.65,1:02:36.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了 你就是开车的人?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:36.39,1:02:38.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那位差点完蛋的
Dialogue: 1,1:02:38.43,1:02:40.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你能说明身份吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:40.19,1:02:41.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行 以後再说
Dialogue: 1,1:02:41.96,1:02:46.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细听着 频道上有其他人 他们都喜欢扣扳机
Dialogue: 1,1:02:46.17,1:02:49.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,情况如下 三十层有大约三十名人质
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.70,1:02:51.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,匪徒的头目叫汉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:02:51.24,1:02:53.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得让他闭嘴 他什么都说了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:53.94,1:02:56.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别管他 我正等着联邦调查局
Dialogue: 1,1:02:56.11,1:02:58.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前 随便他浪费时间
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.31,1:03:00.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们得找到那个背包
Dialogue: 1,1:03:00.68,1:03:02.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,弗里兹 去帮尤里
Dialogue: 1,1:03:02.82,1:03:04.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须夺回雷管
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.25,1:03:08.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有导弹和自动武器
Dialogue: 1,1:03:09.42,1:03:12.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,炸药多到能把阿诺炸上天
Dialogue: 1,1:03:12.33,1:03:17.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在还剩九个 算上刚才那位空中飞人
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.57,1:03:25.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人大多数是欧洲人 从他们的服装…
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.24,1:03:27.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,…和香菸品牌看得出来
Dialogue: 1,1:03:27.84,1:03:29.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们手头富裕 非常专业
Dialogue: 1,1:03:29.58,1:03:31.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道这些的?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.45,1:03:35.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过许多假证件
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.55,1:03:39.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的肯定花了不少钱
Dialogue: 1,1:03:40.05,1:03:43.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 我不知道 这意味着什么
Dialogue: 1,1:03:45.19,1:03:48.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们在这儿遇到的 都是职业高手
Dialogue: 1,1:03:48.20,1:03:50.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 老兄 洛杉矶警局的精锐就到了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.30,1:03:53.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,早就点上了 老兄
Dialogue: 1,1:03:53.60,1:03:55.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么叫你?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:57.20,1:03:58.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:00.21,1:04:01.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.14,1:04:04.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 罗伊 如果你漏了什么
Dialogue: 1,1:04:04.98,1:04:06.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,千万别客气
Dialogue: 1,1:04:06.21,1:04:09.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,找一个安全的地方藏起来 其它的事我们来处理，清楚吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:10.32,1:04:12.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,交给你了 艾尔
Dialogue: 1,1:04:30.04,1:04:31.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在和他们谈判?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:32.41,1:04:35.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是我 长官 鲍尔警官 艾尔·鲍尔
Dialogue: 1,1:04:35.91,1:04:39.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,杜恩·罗宾森 怎么回事? 这些混蛋想要什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.01,1:04:42.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对那些恐怖分子
Dialogue: 1,1:04:42.22,1:04:44.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一无所知
Dialogue: 1,1:04:44.38,1:04:46.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那你刚才在和谁通话?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:47.25,1:04:50.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚 他不想说他的名字
Dialogue: 1,1:04:50.22,1:04:52.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但应该就是报警的那个人
Dialogue: 1,1:04:52.96,1:04:56.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了一名恐怖分子 而且他说还杀了另外两个
Dialogue: 1,1:04:56.26,1:04:57.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他说?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:57.60,1:04:59.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍尔 你有没有想过…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:59.87,1:05:02.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是恐怖分子假扮来骗你?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:02.34,1:05:04.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或是什么疯子?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:04.17,1:05:07.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为不是 长官 实际上我认为他是警察
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.34,1:05:10.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许不是洛杉矶的 但必是一名警察
Dialogue: 1,1:05:10.21,1:05:13.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道? - 直觉 还有他说的话
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.58,1:05:16.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,比如他能分辨假证件
Dialogue: 1,1:05:16.45,1:05:18.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 鲍尔!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.62,1:05:21.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,连酒吧的招待都会做!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:21.19,1:05:22.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,记者来了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:23.66,1:05:25.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 1,1:05:42.28,1:05:43.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个要求
Dialogue: 1,1:05:43.84,1:05:46.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个笨蛋让你当老大?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:46.28,1:05:48.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你
Dialogue: 1,1:05:48.32,1:05:53.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我的老板 现在我最大
Dialogue: 1,1:05:53.62,1:05:58.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不想要这个责任 因为我不想这么靠近你
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.70,1:06:08.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.10,1:06:10.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,外面有一位怀孕的妇女
Dialogue: 1,1:06:10.14,1:06:13.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 她还有几周才会生
Dialogue: 1,1:06:13.14,1:06:16.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是坐在地板上对她的背不好
Dialogue: 1,1:06:16.41,1:06:20.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你准许让她到 办公室的沙发上坐
Dialogue: 1,1:06:21.68,1:06:24.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把沙发搬出来 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:24.68,1:06:26.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.55,1:06:31.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你怕脏的话 最好开始让我们分组去上厕所
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.29,1:06:35.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 你说的对 没问题
Dialogue: 1,1:06:36.50,1:06:37.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的事吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:40.03,1:06:42.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.07,1:06:51.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,青木先生很会选人 你是…
Dialogue: 1,1:06:51.84,1:06:53.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,吉奈萝
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.84,1:06:57.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,吉奈萝小姐
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.78,1:07:02.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们中断节目 播出特别新闻报导
Dialogue: 1,1:07:02.48,1:07:05.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,理查·索伯在世纪城 为您现场报导
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.45,1:07:11.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚 洛杉矶也成为…
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.79,1:07:13.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,遭受国际恐怖分子威胁的
Dialogue: 1,1:07:13.89,1:07:16.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全球城市之列
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.06,1:07:21.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大约两个小时以前 一群身份不详的恐怖分子
Dialogue: 1,1:07:21.50,1:07:26.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,占领了中富大厦 封锁了所有入口和出口
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.61,1:07:30.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,电话线全部被切断 现在唯一的通讯手段
Dialogue: 1,1:07:30.98,1:07:33.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就是无线电对讲机
Dialogue: 1,1:07:33.98,1:07:36.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,显然是由恐怖分子带来的
Dialogue: 1,1:07:36.42,1:07:40.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警方称占领这座大厦的暴徒…
Dialogue: 1,1:07:41.02,1:07:43.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,第五组 在主入口处待命
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.02,1:07:48.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,查理那一组在停车场…
Dialogue: 1,1:07:48.16,1:07:52.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想问一下 这道楼梯是不是直通电梯?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:52.30,1:07:55.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 - 告诉他们继续
Dialogue: 1,1:07:56.04,1:07:57.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:58.44,1:08:00.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你看呢?我们要冲进去
Dialogue: 1,1:08:00.74,1:08:05.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,冲进去!你疯了吗? 上面可能有30名人质
Dialogue: 1,1:08:05.61,1:08:07.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么也不知道 鲍尔
Dialogue: 1,1:08:07.61,1:08:11.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人质 为什么不提出赎金的数目?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:11.12,1:08:14.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有恐怖分子 他们为什么不提出要求?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:14.45,1:08:16.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只知道 有人向你的车开枪
Dialogue: 1,1:08:16.79,1:08:18.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定就是
Dialogue: 1,1:08:19.03,1:08:21.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才和你通话的蠢货
Dialogue: 1,1:08:21.13,1:08:22.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 长官!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:22.86,1:08:26.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那具从天而降的屍体 又怎么解释?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:26.23,1:08:29.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许是破产的股票经纪人 - 我们准备好了 局长
Dialogue: 1,1:08:29.34,1:08:31.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 把灯打开 行动 - 把灯打开
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.81,1:08:34.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 蓝队行动 - 开灯
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.62,1:08:48.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍尔?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:48.99,1:08:51.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾尔 你还在吗 伙计? 这是怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:52.39,1:08:53.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 艾尔?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:53.83,1:08:57.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿 罗伊 不过我现在很忙 过会儿再说
Dialogue: 1,1:08:57.63,1:08:58.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾尔 怎么回事?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:58.67,1:09:00.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了过会儿再说
Dialogue: 1,1:09:00.43,1:09:02.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是我想的那样
Dialogue: 1,1:09:02.57,1:09:05.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你该知道 何时该听 何时闭嘴…
Dialogue: 1,1:09:06.61,1:09:08.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,何时该祈祷
Dialogue: 1,1:09:08.64,1:09:10.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 你们想冲进来! 是不是?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:12.05,1:09:14.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说过 这些家伙不是好惹的
Dialogue: 1,1:09:14.51,1:09:16.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,作好准备
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.25,1:09:22.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他们来了 大家准备好
Dialogue: 1,1:09:23.62,1:09:26.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西奥 你负责监视
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.71,1:09:40.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,雷沃!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:40.11,1:09:42.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开始侦察行动
Dialogue: 1,1:09:43.51,1:09:44.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.12,1:09:49.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:08.64,1:10:10.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!上吧!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:21.78,1:10:22.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 1,1:10:56.68,1:10:59.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大家散开
Dialogue: 1,1:11:06.63,1:11:07.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(卸货区)
Dialogue: 1,1:11:25.01,1:11:26.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 1,1:11:28.38,1:11:30.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:34.92,1:11:36.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些鲁莽的笨蛋 不!不!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:40.76,1:11:42.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 大夥听着
Dialogue: 1,1:11:43.96,1:11:46.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞前夕
Dialogue: 1,1:11:46.23,1:11:48.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,万籁俱寂
Dialogue: 1,1:11:48.34,1:11:50.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,屋内一片平静，除了…
Dialogue: 1,1:11:50.84,1:11:53.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,四个家伙想从後面进来
Dialogue: 1,1:11:53.87,1:11:55.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,标准两两掩护队形
Dialogue: 1,1:11:58.15,1:11:59.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 我们已经到位
Dialogue: 1,1:12:00.78,1:12:02.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:02.82,1:12:04.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干吧
Dialogue: 1,1:12:04.25,1:12:05.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.45,1:12:07.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好 行动
Dialogue: 1,1:12:23.10,1:12:24.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,遭受攻击!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.91,1:12:26.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们朝蓝队开枪!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.51,1:12:30.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 乱开枪 他们什么也看不见 - 他们在射探照灯
Dialogue: 1,1:12:34.82,1:12:38.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的目标是探照灯 叫他们回来
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.32,1:12:40.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这锁打不开
Dialogue: 1,1:12:40.82,1:12:42.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 烧开它!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:44.29,1:12:45.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,沉住气
Dialogue: 1,1:12:46.83,1:12:48.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打伤就可以了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:50.63,1:12:53.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们回来! 没有灯光他们都是靶子
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.27,1:12:55.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他们就要进去了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:55.10,1:12:56.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让装甲车过来
Dialogue: 1,1:12:56.57,1:12:58.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让装甲车过来
Dialogue: 1,1:13:11.35,1:13:12.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!
Dialogue: 1,1:13:15.86,1:13:18.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,雷沃!罗德里格斯! 回话
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.69,1:13:21.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 猜猜是谁来了?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:25.67,1:13:28.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警方派来一辆大玩具
Dialogue: 1,1:13:33.64,1:13:34.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,东南角
Dialogue: 1,1:13:48.05,1:13:49.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝
Dialogue: 1,1:14:01.87,1:14:04.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走开!退後!
Dialogue: 1,1:14:06.37,1:14:07.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快到那边去
Dialogue: 1,1:14:43.71,1:14:44.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见他了!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:03.96,1:15:06.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天! 四分卫完蛋了!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:07.57,1:15:10.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,撑着 雷沃! 这是命令!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:11.40,1:15:12.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次
Dialogue: 1,1:15:12.44,1:15:15.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯 你这个王八蛋! 你成功了 让他们走!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:15.78,1:15:17.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 牛仔先生 我会考虑你的意见，但…
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.41,1:15:18.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再来
Dialogue: 1,1:15:19.08,1:15:20.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一次
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.09,1:15:35.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,发射
Dialogue: 1,1:15:49.98,1:15:51.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的
Dialogue: 1,1:15:52.01,1:15:54.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们救出来! 他们就要被烧死了!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:04.82,1:16:05.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 1,1:16:17.87,1:16:21.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个意见你接不接受 蠢货
Dialogue: 1,1:16:25.21,1:16:27.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 王八蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:45.90,1:16:46.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:52.17,1:16:53.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们用大炮打我们!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:53.87,1:16:55.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货 不是警方干的
Dialogue: 1,1:16:56.51,1:16:58.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是他
Dialogue: 1,1:17:05.75,1:17:07.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:12.36,1:17:13.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:16.00,1:17:18.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉我你拍到了 - 拍到了
Dialogue: 1,1:17:20.33,1:17:22.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,最佳镜头 第五频道
Dialogue: 1,1:17:22.90,1:17:26.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,占据中富大厦的恐怖分子 我们有最新了解
Dialogue: 1,1:17:26.94,1:17:29.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有消息称他们的领导 汉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:17:29.18,1:17:31.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是汉斯·格鲁伯
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.31,1:17:34.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,激进的西德人民阵线组织成员
Dialogue: 1,1:17:34.31,1:17:38.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的是 人民阵线领导人一小时前
Dialogue: 1,1:17:38.18,1:17:40.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,声称格鲁伯 已被逐出该组织
Dialogue: 1,1:17:41.09,1:17:43.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾尔?听到了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:43.52,1:17:44.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:45.89,1:17:47.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我很好
Dialogue: 1,1:17:48.36,1:17:49.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才怎么回事?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:49.80,1:17:52.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我说过的塑胶炸药吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:52.80,1:17:55.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 记得 - 就是它 大厦起火了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:55.80,1:17:57.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 不过需要重新刷漆
Dialogue: 1,1:17:57.70,1:17:59.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还要换许多玻璃门
Dialogue: 1,1:17:59.37,1:18:02.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,观察哨说 爆炸干掉两个
Dialogue: 1,1:18:02.21,1:18:04.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是他吗? - 是 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:18:06.38,1:18:09.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你听好了 先生 我不知道你想干嘛
Dialogue: 1,1:18:09.15,1:18:11.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你毁了一座大厦!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:11.72,1:18:14.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要你的帮助 明白了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:14.85,1:18:16.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 1,1:18:16.79,1:18:19.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下面有一百多人 被碎玻璃活埋啦
Dialogue: 1,1:18:19.96,1:18:22.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,玻璃?谁还管他妈的玻璃?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.96,1:18:23.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的是谁?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:25.53,1:18:28.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是副局长杜恩·罗宾森
Dialogue: 1,1:18:28.27,1:18:30.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里我说了算
Dialogue: 1,1:18:30.34,1:18:32.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你说了算?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:32.21,1:18:34.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有些坏消息要告诉你 杜恩
Dialogue: 1,1:18:34.27,1:18:37.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从我这看 你他妈的屁也管不了
Dialogue: 1,1:18:37.64,1:18:39.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听着 你这个白痴
Dialogue: 1,1:18:39.85,1:18:40.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:40.78,1:18:42.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在电视上丢脸的
Dialogue: 1,1:18:42.62,1:18:44.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是我 杜恩!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.89,1:18:47.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听着 蠢货
Dialogue: 1,1:18:47.82,1:18:50.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有办法 就别在这儿捣乱
Dialogue: 1,1:18:50.89,1:18:54.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把对讲机还给刚才的那个人
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.86,1:18:58.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 罗伊 感觉怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:58.63,1:19:00.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到很不得志 艾尔
Dialogue: 1,1:19:00.70,1:19:03.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 听着 我喜欢你
Dialogue: 1,1:19:03.07,1:19:05.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都喜欢你
Dialogue: 1,1:19:05.44,1:19:08.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要坚持住 听到了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:08.11,1:19:10.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要坚持住
Dialogue: 1,1:19:11.61,1:19:14.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,明白 谢谢 伙计
Dialogue: 1,1:19:20.02,1:19:21.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:21.45,1:19:25.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想坐在这儿 看谁先把我们杀死
Dialogue: 1,1:19:25.33,1:19:26.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还是你丈夫
Dialogue: 1,1:19:26.93,1:19:28.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:28.60,1:19:34.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我一顿饭就能谈下百万美元 难道连这些人渣都对付不了?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:34.10,1:19:37.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 谈谈怎么样 嗯?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:37.07,1:19:39.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是听我的 他早就被困住了
Dialogue: 1,1:19:40.04,1:19:42.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想困住他 我要他死
Dialogue: 1,1:19:43.14,1:19:45.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有打搅你们吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:45.14,1:19:46.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他想要什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:46.28,1:19:49.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我想要什么 而是我能给你们什么
Dialogue: 1,1:19:57.36,1:19:59.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我还是直说了吧
Dialogue: 1,1:20:00.96,1:20:04.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 你们到这来不只是 为了偷几个小钱 对吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:04.50,1:20:06.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你很会观察
Dialogue: 1,1:20:06.23,1:20:07.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我有在看“六十分钟”
Dialogue: 1,1:20:07.97,1:20:10.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我对自己说:“这些人都是行家
Dialogue: 1,1:20:10.74,1:20:13.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有动机、他们有计划”
Dialogue: 1,1:20:13.27,1:20:14.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 他们想要什么东西
Dialogue: 1,1:20:14.94,1:20:17.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我个人并不关心 你们的政治信仰
Dialogue: 1,1:20:17.84,1:20:20.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们对阿拉伯人不满
Dialogue: 1,1:20:20.15,1:20:23.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是以色列或是北爱 这不关我的事
Dialogue: 1,1:20:23.15,1:20:25.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是来谈判的 不错吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:25.55,1:20:26.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,令人惊讶
Dialogue: 1,1:20:26.75,1:20:29.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全部是你自己想出来的?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:29.19,1:20:31.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 生意就是生意
Dialogue: 1,1:20:31.39,1:20:34.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们用枪 我用笔 有什么区别?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:34.73,1:20:37.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我这样说吧 你们的目的是钱
Dialogue: 1,1:20:37.40,1:20:41.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你计划好一切 但没想到有一颗老鼠屎坏事
Dialogue: 1,1:20:42.10,1:20:43.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:43.54,1:20:45.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:20:45.17,1:20:46.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟
Dialogue: 1,1:20:46.74,1:20:48.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是你的白骑士
Dialogue: 1,1:20:49.61,1:20:52.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我没看过“六十分钟”
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.38,1:20:54.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:55.82,1:20:59.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,楼上那家伙坏了你们的事 嗯?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:03.42,1:21:06.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把他交给你
Dialogue: 1,1:21:08.09,1:21:10.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:12.23,1:21:14.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊! 罗伊 你还好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:15.84,1:21:18.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些饼乾比我还老
Dialogue: 1,1:21:19.91,1:21:21.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它是什么东西做的?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.84,1:21:26.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,高糖面粉、氢化植物油…
Dialogue: 1,1:21:26.85,1:21:28.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,聚山梨醇酯60
Dialogue: 1,1:21:28.38,1:21:30.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五号黄色色素
Dialogue: 1,1:21:30.18,1:21:33.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子发育需要的一切营养
Dialogue: 1,1:21:33.72,1:21:35.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有多少个孩子 艾尔?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:35.66,1:21:39.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我的妻子正怀第一个
Dialogue: 1,1:21:39.79,1:21:41.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢 牛仔?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:41.53,1:21:44.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的农场里有孩子吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:45.23,1:21:46.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有
Dialogue: 1,1:21:47.03,1:21:48.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,两个
Dialogue: 1,1:21:48.53,1:21:52.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们以後 能和你儿子一起荡秋千
Dialogue: 1,1:21:55.14,1:21:56.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那就说定了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:56.98,1:21:59.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你可要带冰淇淋来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:59.58,1:22:01.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,感人 牛仔 非常感人
Dialogue: 1,1:22:02.75,1:22:04.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我该叫你
Dialogue: 1,1:22:04.15,1:22:06.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连先生?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.59,1:22:10.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约警察局的
Dialogue: 1,1:22:10.36,1:22:12.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·麦克连警官
Dialogue: 1,1:22:14.59,1:22:16.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给纽约的哈里打电话
Dialogue: 1,1:22:16.93,1:22:19.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你让指挥中心的人查一查
Dialogue: 1,1:22:19.40,1:22:23.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,德蕾莎修女在三年级时 叫我麦克连先生
Dialogue: 1,1:22:23.90,1:22:28.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友们叫我约翰 你谁也不是 人渣
Dialogue: 1,1:22:30.28,1:22:34.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这有个人想和你谈谈 一位特殊的朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:22:34.95,1:22:37.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,晚会上和你在一起的
Dialogue: 1,1:22:43.52,1:22:45.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 约翰兄
Dialogue: 1,1:22:46.93,1:22:48.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:48.66,1:22:49.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 1,1:22:50.06,1:22:54.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在听着 约翰 他们给我几分钟让我跟你说话
Dialogue: 1,1:22:54.10,1:22:57.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你认为自己在尽职
Dialogue: 1,1:22:57.27,1:23:02.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我表示感谢 但你让情况变得复杂
Dialogue: 1,1:23:02.14,1:23:03.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让这些人和洛杉矶警察谈判
Dialogue: 1,1:23:03.94,1:23:07.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须停止捣乱 否则谁也甭想出去 明白吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:12.89,1:23:14.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯 你对他们说过什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:16.09,1:23:18.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们是老朋友 而今天晚上…
Dialogue: 1,1:23:18.89,1:23:20.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的客人
Dialogue: 1,1:23:21.39,1:23:23.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯 你不该这么做
Dialogue: 1,1:23:23.46,1:23:25.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个不用你说?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:31.34,1:23:33.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 约翰 听着
Dialogue: 1,1:23:34.07,1:23:36.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想让你说出雷管的下落
Dialogue: 1,1:23:36.41,1:23:38.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道有人在听
Dialogue: 1,1:23:38.75,1:23:42.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要雷管 否则他们会杀了我
Dialogue: 1,1:23:46.29,1:23:47.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 你听见了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:50.12,1:23:51.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我听见了
Dialogue: 1,1:23:52.09,1:23:56.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 约翰 我想你还是别管闲事了 嗯? 警察已经到了 这是他们的事
Dialogue: 1,1:23:56.73,1:23:59.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们雷管在哪儿 就没有人会受伤!
Dialogue: 1,1:23:59.37,1:24:02.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 我是在为你赌命 老兄
Dialogue: 1,1:24:02.50,1:24:04.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯 你仔细地听我说
Dialogue: 1,1:24:04.44,1:24:05.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰…
Dialogue: 1,1:24:05.17,1:24:07.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 艾利斯!马上给我闭嘴!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:07.94,1:24:09.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把对讲机交给汉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:24:09.44,1:24:14.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯 这个蠢货不了解情况 但我知道 听着
Dialogue: 1,1:24:14.11,1:24:17.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 那就交出雷管 拯救你朋友的生命
Dialogue: 1,1:24:17.65,1:24:19.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事与你毫无关系
Dialogue: 1,1:24:19.95,1:24:22.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 那我呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:22.36,1:24:25.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 把枪拿开 这是对讲机 不是电视
Dialogue: 1,1:24:25.76,1:24:29.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯 这个混蛋不是我朋友! 我们刚碰面 我根本不认识他
Dialogue: 1,1:24:29.46,1:24:34.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾利斯 这些人会杀了你! 告诉他们你不认识我!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:34.60,1:24:37.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年的交情 怎么能这么说?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:37.07,1:24:40.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?约翰?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:04.26,1:25:05.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见啦?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:06.20,1:25:09.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 我的雷管在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:09.07,1:25:11.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,说出来 否则我就再杀一个
Dialogue: 1,1:25:11.77,1:25:15.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迟早会轮到 那个你真正关心的人
Dialogue: 1,1:25:16.24,1:25:18.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的 汉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:25:20.05,1:25:22.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听到吗 是他害死了那个人
Dialogue: 1,1:25:22.22,1:25:24.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他不管他的死活 把对讲机给我
Dialogue: 1,1:25:24.32,1:25:26.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这和亲手扣扳机没什么两样
Dialogue: 1,1:25:26.52,1:25:30.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不知道是怎么回事吗? 难道你看不出来吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:30.26,1:25:32.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他尽了一切努力去救他!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:32.66,1:25:35.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他投降 那么他俩都已经死了!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:35.86,1:25:38.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不行 他们要和我们谈判
Dialogue: 1,1:25:38.63,1:25:42.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 告诉你那位夥伴 从现在开始别再插手 你听见了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:42.20,1:25:45.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他不听 我就要他好看 听着 我会给他好看的
Dialogue: 1,1:25:45.84,1:25:49.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经受伤 孤单又疲惫
Dialogue: 1,1:25:49.08,1:25:52.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下面的这些人却无所事事
Dialogue: 1,1:25:52.85,1:25:55.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你却站在这儿告诉我
Dialogue: 1,1:25:55.41,1:25:58.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就算他能活着出来 你也要给他好看?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:58.68,1:26:01.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好好想想自己说的这些屁话
Dialogue: 1,1:26:01.69,1:26:03.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听着 警官
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.32,1:26:06.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想回家 随时可以辞职
Dialogue: 1,1:26:07.09,1:26:10.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 长官 你甭想赶我走!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:10.33,1:26:12.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警方注意
Dialogue: 1,1:26:13.37,1:26:15.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警方注意
Dialogue: 1,1:26:15.57,1:26:18.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是艾尔·鲍尔警官 - 把它给我
Dialogue: 1,1:26:18.77,1:26:21.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是、这是副局长 杜恩·罗宾森
Dialogue: 1,1:26:21.34,1:26:22.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:22.34,1:26:24.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是汉斯·格鲁伯
Dialogue: 1,1:26:25.14,1:26:28.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们 已经知道进攻我们的直接後果
Dialogue: 1,1:26:28.75,1:26:30.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想再有人丧命
Dialogue: 1,1:26:30.75,1:26:33.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想要什么 格鲁伯先生?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.89,1:26:38.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同志 正在世界各地受牢狱之苦
Dialogue: 1,1:26:38.19,1:26:41.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,美国政府不是 喜欢到处炫耀武力吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:41.99,1:26:44.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在为我炫耀一回吧
Dialogue: 1,1:26:45.46,1:26:49.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以下这些人必须被立即释放
Dialogue: 1,1:26:49.74,1:26:52.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,北爱尔兰扣押的 七名爱尔兰共和军成员
Dialogue: 1,1:26:52.94,1:26:57.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,加拿大扣押的五名 魁北克解放运动领导人
Dialogue: 1,1:26:57.68,1:27:01.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,斯里兰卡扣押的 九名亚洲曙光运动组织成员
Dialogue: 1,1:27:01.71,1:27:03.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:03.28,1:27:05.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,亚洲曙光运动?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:05.18,1:27:07.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在《时代》杂志上看到的
Dialogue: 1,1:27:07.79,1:27:11.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些革命的兄弟姐妹 重获自由以後
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.79,1:27:14.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人质将被押到大厦楼顶
Dialogue: 1,1:27:15.09,1:27:19.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们将和我们一起乘直升机 到达洛杉矶国际机场
Dialogue: 1,1:27:19.83,1:27:22.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,到那里後 我再告诉你下一步该怎么做
Dialogue: 1,1:27:22.54,1:27:24.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有两个小时的时间
Dialogue: 1,1:27:24.50,1:27:27.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 稍等一下 格鲁伯先生
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.04,1:27:31.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我、我、我没有这个权力 两个小时根本不够
Dialogue: 1,1:27:31.91,1:27:34.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 哈罗?哈罗?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:36.25,1:27:39.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你都录下来了吗? 我们去打几个电话
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.52,1:27:41.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为他们会照办吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:41.75,1:27:43.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,管他呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:46.16,1:27:48.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西奥 进展如何?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:48.39,1:27:50.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一道锁 然後就看你的了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:50.43,1:27:53.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,最好你是对的 要打开最後一道 只能靠奇蹟了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:53.97,1:27:55.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是圣诞节 西奥
Dialogue: 1,1:27:55.57,1:27:58.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是奇蹟的节日 保持愉快的心情
Dialogue: 1,1:27:58.20,1:28:01.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,解最後一道锁的时候再告诉我
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.74,1:28:02.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔
Dialogue: 1,1:28:02.84,1:28:06.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉那个小混蛋 把雷管夺回来
Dialogue: 1,1:28:06.58,1:28:08.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,佛里正在检查炸药
Dialogue: 1,1:28:08.81,1:28:11.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我去检查炸药 你只管夺回雷管
Dialogue: 1,1:28:12.42,1:28:13.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计 你还在吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.29,1:28:17.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿 约翰 我在这儿
Dialogue: 1,1:28:17.19,1:28:20.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须相信我 我已经无能为力了
Dialogue: 1,1:28:22.03,1:28:24.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你错了 我们俩都得倒霉
Dialogue: 1,1:28:24.86,1:28:26.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: 1,1:28:32.30,1:28:34.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见汉斯的那套鬼话了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:34.84,1:28:37.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不太对头 伙计
Dialogue: 1,1:28:38.68,1:28:42.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 不要问我 我只是一个 在你求救时正想回家的警察
Dialogue: 1,1:28:42.82,1:28:46.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看你开车的样子 还以为你是个巡警
Dialogue: 1,1:28:46.49,1:28:49.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我年轻的时候曾经是
Dialogue: 1,1:28:49.92,1:28:53.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,人质与恐怖分子双向研究
Dialogue: 1,1:28:53.79,1:28:54.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,的作者海瑟多夫博士
Dialogue: 1,1:28:55.06,1:28:58.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,海瑟多夫博士 你预期 接下来的几小时会怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:58.86,1:28:59.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 盖儿 在这个时候…
Dialogue: 1,1:28:59.49,1:29:02.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,人质将经历
Dialogue: 1,1:29:02.20,1:29:04.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,赫尔辛基症候群的早期阶段
Dialogue: 1,1:29:04.53,1:29:06.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就是瑞典的赫尔辛基
Dialogue: 1,1:29:06.47,1:29:08.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是芬兰
Dialogue: 1,1:29:08.14,1:29:11.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,基本上 人质与恐怖分子
Dialogue: 1,1:29:11.84,1:29:14.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将经历某种心理转移
Dialogue: 1,1:29:14.54,1:29:16.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,并产生彼此依赖的感觉
Dialogue: 1,1:29:16.75,1:29:19.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,发展出某种奇怪的信任与友情
Dialogue: 1,1:29:19.68,1:29:22.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在某些案例中 人质在获释後…
Dialogue: 1,1:29:22.35,1:29:24.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,会拥抱绑架者
Dialogue: 1,1:29:24.75,1:29:27.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至和狱中的他们通信
Dialogue: 1,1:29:27.36,1:29:30.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 宝贝 是亚洲曙光
Dialogue: 1,1:29:30.23,1:29:33.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是曙光
Dialogue: 1,1:29:33.26,1:29:34.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 长官? - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:34.76,1:29:36.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局的人来了
Dialogue: 1,1:29:36.77,1:29:40.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们来了? - 对 长官 就在那边
Dialogue: 1,1:29:40.67,1:29:41.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着
Dialogue: 1,1:29:42.10,1:29:44.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不来点口香糖吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:48.38,1:29:50.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你还好吗 伙计?
Dialogue: 1,1:29:50.85,1:29:53.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是探员强森 这位是特别探员强森
Dialogue: 1,1:29:53.55,1:29:56.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 你们好吗? - 不是亲戚
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.72,1:30:03.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杜恩.罗宾森 洛杉矶警察局的 负责这里
Dialogue: 1,1:30:03.66,1:30:05.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不再是了
Dialogue: 1,1:31:00.42,1:31:03.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 伙计 你好啊?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:09.92,1:31:13.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊! 你是他们一夥的 对吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:13.16,1:31:14.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是他们一夥的
Dialogue: 1,1:31:14.80,1:31:17.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 别杀我 求求你!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:17.77,1:31:20.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别杀我!求求你!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:20.34,1:31:23.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放松!我不会伤害你
Dialogue: 1,1:31:23.17,1:31:24.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:27.41,1:31:29.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天
Dialogue: 1,1:31:32.48,1:31:35.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这上面干什么? 你在找什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:35.78,1:31:38.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我设法逃了出来 我…
Dialogue: 1,1:31:38.29,1:31:41.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想逃到楼顶
Dialogue: 1,1:31:41.49,1:31:44.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看看能否发出求救信号
Dialogue: 1,1:31:45.69,1:31:47.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就从这边走 你可以过来帮我…
Dialogue: 1,1:31:47.90,1:31:51.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 不能去楼顶
Dialogue: 1,1:31:51.77,1:31:54.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了 不能去楼顶 到处都是他们的人
Dialogue: 1,1:31:56.00,1:31:58.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想活命 就和我在一起
Dialogue: 1,1:32:01.31,1:32:03.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在只知道
Dialogue: 1,1:32:03.45,1:32:06.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许在第30层有大约
Dialogue: 1,1:32:07.02,1:32:08.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,30到35名人质
Dialogue: 1,1:32:09.02,1:32:12.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和大概七八个匪徒
Dialogue: 1,1:32:12.72,1:32:14.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像是A-7状况
Dialogue: 1,1:32:14.99,1:32:17.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 从现在开始由我们接管
Dialogue: 1,1:32:17.49,1:32:20.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,需要用你的人时 我会通知你的
Dialogue: 1,1:32:20.43,1:32:22.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是忘了点什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:22.46,1:32:23.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:23.53,1:32:25.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·麦克连呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:25.27,1:32:28.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有他 才有我们刚才那些资料
Dialogue: 1,1:32:28.50,1:32:32.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有他 你们要对付的只剩七个 而不是十二个匪徒
Dialogue: 1,1:32:32.21,1:32:34.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他在里面?他是谁?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:34.64,1:32:37.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他也许是个警察 我们正在核实
Dialogue: 1,1:32:37.65,1:32:40.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是你的人? - 不 绝对不是
Dialogue: 1,1:32:45.85,1:32:46.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你抽菸吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:48.26,1:32:49.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 1,1:32:54.50,1:32:55.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:32:59.57,1:33:02.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是中富公司的
Dialogue: 1,1:33:06.74,1:33:09.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不是恐怖分子
Dialogue: 1,1:33:11.71,1:33:14.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是纽约警察
Dialogue: 1,1:33:15.05,1:33:16.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:16.72,1:33:17.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 1,1:33:18.72,1:33:21.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,阴差阳错来参加这个晚会
Dialogue: 1,1:33:21.66,1:33:22.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到
Dialogue: 1,1:33:31.53,1:33:35.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,总比光着屁股被抓到好 嗯?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:42.91,1:33:44.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫约翰·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,1:33:45.71,1:33:47.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 1,1:33:48.58,1:33:49.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,克雷
Dialogue: 1,1:33:52.19,1:33:53.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔·克雷
Dialogue: 1,1:33:59.69,1:34:01.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,知道怎么用手枪吗 比尔?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:03.16,1:34:05.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾在野战营过了一星期
Dialogue: 1,1:34:05.23,1:34:07.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那种 发射红色颜料球的枪吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:07.60,1:34:09.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许对你来说有点傻
Dialogue: 1,1:34:11.24,1:34:12.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 1,1:34:15.58,1:34:17.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要动真格的了 比尔
Dialogue: 1,1:34:25.95,1:34:28.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扣下扳机就对了
Dialogue: 1,1:34:28.92,1:34:29.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:34:48.94,1:34:53.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下 把雷管还给我
Dialogue: 1,1:34:57.65,1:34:59.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看看是谁
Dialogue: 1,1:35:01.02,1:35:02.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:35:03.09,1:35:05.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下 马上
Dialogue: 1,1:35:09.23,1:35:12.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,装出那种口音的确不简单
Dialogue: 1,1:35:12.83,1:35:16.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该上电视表演
Dialogue: 1,1:35:18.31,1:35:21.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要这些雷管想干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:22.04,1:35:24.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经用光了所有炸药
Dialogue: 1,1:35:27.05,1:35:28.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:29.85,1:35:31.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只数到三
Dialogue: 1,1:35:31.52,1:35:33.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 就像对高木那样?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:37.69,1:35:39.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有子弹
Dialogue: 1,1:35:39.09,1:35:42.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我很蠢吗 汉斯?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:42.26,1:35:43.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:48.30,1:36:50.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打碎玻璃
Dialogue: 1,1:37:23.56,1:37:25.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:54.33,1:37:57.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,笑吧 卡尔 我们又开张了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:59.97,1:38:02.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,…是外交的最後手段
Dialogue: 1,1:38:03.04,1:38:06.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们或许可以这么说
Dialogue: 1,1:38:06.17,1:38:09.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怖主义也有同样的效果
Dialogue: 1,1:38:09.78,1:38:11.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你找到什么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:38:12.01,1:38:15.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只有麦克连的名字、警徽号 任职记录、基本数据
Dialogue: 1,1:38:16.05,1:38:18.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和他家人的地址
Dialogue: 1,1:38:18.62,1:38:20.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就在洛杉矶这里
Dialogue: 1,1:38:28.26,1:38:29.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去工作
Dialogue: 1,1:38:29.63,1:38:31.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,明白
Dialogue: 1,1:38:43.58,1:38:46.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 那个人好像真的很生气
Dialogue: 1,1:38:49.18,1:38:51.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着
Dialogue: 1,1:38:51.52,1:38:52.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:38:52.89,1:38:56.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只有约翰才能把人逼成那样
Dialogue: 1,1:39:13.71,1:39:18.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯 快带你的奇蹟来 我们刚打开第六道
Dialogue: 1,1:39:18.11,1:39:20.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,电磁密封突然就启动了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:20.88,1:39:26.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 先看看窗外的朋友 在干什么 我马上就到
Dialogue: 1,1:39:28.65,1:39:29.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 约翰
Dialogue: 1,1:39:29.89,1:39:32.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·麦克连 你还在吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:39:32.42,1:39:33.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 1,1:39:34.33,1:39:38.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要是让我选 我宁愿到费城去
Dialogue: 1,1:39:38.73,1:39:40.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又干掉两个坏蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:39:41.23,1:39:44.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴听到这消息
Dialogue: 1,1:39:44.87,1:39:46.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 我们都在你身上下了注
Dialogue: 1,1:39:46.84,1:39:48.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在的赔率是多少?
Dialogue: 1,1:39:48.77,1:39:50.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好别知道
Dialogue: 1,1:39:50.54,1:39:51.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我下20块
Dialogue: 1,1:39:52.08,1:39:53.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我赔得起
Dialogue: 1,1:39:57.15,1:39:59.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 鲍尔 你是平足吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:02.32,1:40:04.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是什么意思 伙计?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:04.59,1:40:06.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不干巡警了?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:07.13,1:40:08.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这有什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:08.39,1:40:11.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为在办公桌後面 整理文件就不是警察了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:13.57,1:40:14.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 1,1:40:18.30,1:40:20.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我出过一次意外
Dialogue: 1,1:40:20.41,1:40:22.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,像你那样开车肯定得出事
Dialogue: 1,1:40:22.77,1:40:23.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么事故?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:23.61,1:40:26.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开车轧了队长的脚吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:30.08,1:40:31.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了一个孩子
Dialogue: 1,1:40:32.88,1:40:34.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他当时只有13岁
Dialogue: 1,1:40:35.95,1:40:39.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天很黑 我看不清楚 他拿着逼真的玩具枪
Dialogue: 1,1:40:43.30,1:40:46.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警察学校 把你从菜鸟教成老手
Dialogue: 1,1:40:46.70,1:40:48.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,却没教你怎么背下责任
Dialogue: 1,1:40:52.97,1:40:57.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 我再也无法 用枪指着任何人了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:00.81,1:41:02.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 伙计
Dialogue: 1,1:41:03.65,1:41:06.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计 你能体会吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:08.72,1:41:10.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在感觉很糟
Dialogue: 1,1:41:13.56,1:41:15.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那我还是告诉你吧
Dialogue: 1,1:41:15.23,1:41:19.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是洛杉矶警察掌舵了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:22.43,1:41:23.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,调查局?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:24.14,1:41:25.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说对了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:27.87,1:41:30.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 这些是市政工程师
Dialogue: 1,1:41:30.34,1:41:31.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 1,1:41:31.88,1:41:34.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在查看街道电路
Dialogue: 1,1:41:34.68,1:41:36.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看那些穿西装的家伙 不知是干什么的
Dialogue: 1,1:41:36.98,1:41:38.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是调查局的
Dialogue: 1,1:41:38.82,1:41:42.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们依照程序 下令切断大厦的电源
Dialogue: 1,1:41:42.49,1:41:44.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,像发条一样规律
Dialogue: 1,1:41:46.36,1:41:47.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就像一把钥匙
Dialogue: 1,1:41:48.43,1:41:50.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正确
Dialogue: 1,1:41:50.26,1:41:54.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为了对抗一起恐怖活动…
Dialogue: 1,1:41:54.17,1:41:56.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无法切断的电路 於是被迫切断了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:57.00,1:41:58.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,想要奇蹟 西奥 就去找…
Dialogue: 1,1:41:59.20,1:42:02.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局
Dialogue: 1,1:42:04.48,1:42:05.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你切断这座大厦的电源!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:05.48,1:42:07.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我这儿有点问题
Dialogue: 1,1:42:07.71,1:42:11.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管你有什么样的问题! 必须关闭这个开关
Dialogue: 1,1:42:12.68,1:42:14.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不能从这儿切断
Dialogue: 1,1:42:14.32,1:42:16.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以 - 不能从这儿切断!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:16.82,1:42:18.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以…我有对讲机
Dialogue: 1,1:42:18.59,1:42:22.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不能从这儿切断电源 只能从市中心切断
Dialogue: 1,1:42:22.13,1:42:26.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,整个电网都会断电 这关系到十个街区
Dialogue: 1,1:42:26.06,1:42:27.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,十个街区? 天哪 强森 你疯了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:28.00,1:42:30.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是圣诞夜 成千上万的人…
Dialogue: 1,1:42:30.67,1:42:32.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须这样做!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:32.44,1:42:37.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我需要授权! - 美国政府授权还不够吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:37.61,1:42:39.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,切断电网 要么丢掉饭碗
Dialogue: 1,1:42:45.85,1:42:47.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,中心吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:47.72,1:42:50.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是沃尔特 在中富大厦
Dialogue: 1,1:42:50.12,1:42:55.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你帮我切断212电网好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:55.13,1:42:56.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:56.36,1:42:59.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我该给市长打个电话
Dialogue: 1,1:42:59.10,1:43:02.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,倒霉的是我 我这儿麻烦大了 快关掉
Dialogue: 1,1:43:02.27,1:43:04.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,切断电源 马上!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:07.94,1:43:10.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,启动紧急电源
Dialogue: 1,1:43:10.78,1:43:13.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍尔!回答我 这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.71,1:43:15.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去问调查局吧
Dialogue: 1,1:43:15.31,1:43:18.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正拿着反恐怖指南
Dialogue: 1,1:43:18.15,1:43:19.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,按部就班地照办
Dialogue: 1,1:43:22.72,1:43:24.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要打开了 要开了!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:26.46,1:43:27.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的！
Dialogue: 1,1:43:50.72,1:43:52.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:53.72,1:43:56.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那帮杂种可能已经尿了裤子了
Dialogue: 1,1:43:56.96,1:43:58.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,市长会杀了我
Dialogue: 1,1:44:20.15,1:44:22.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们该怎么办?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:22.45,1:44:25.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为拒付电费逮捕他们吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:25.58,1:44:27.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们关在里面
Dialogue: 1,1:44:27.42,1:44:30.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们流点冷汗 然後给他们直昇机
Dialogue: 1,1:44:30.96,1:44:33.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个不留
Dialogue: 1,1:44:35.76,1:44:37.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是强森探员
Dialogue: 1,1:44:37.36,1:44:38.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是另一个
Dialogue: 1,1:44:38.83,1:44:42.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要空中支援在五分钟内出发
Dialogue: 1,1:44:42.20,1:44:45.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 全副武装 我们马上就到
Dialogue: 1,1:44:51.61,1:44:53.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,耶!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:55.21,1:44:57.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和联邦调查局的人谈
Dialogue: 1,1:45:00.22,1:45:02.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是特别探员强森
Dialogue: 1,1:45:02.42,1:45:06.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,州政府已经安排你的同志们回家了
Dialogue: 1,1:45:06.99,1:45:09.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,直昇机马上就到 按照你的要求
Dialogue: 1,1:45:09.69,1:45:11.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 我们正在准备
Dialogue: 1,1:45:12.03,1:45:14.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等他知道上当的时候 已经在屍袋里了
Dialogue: 1,1:45:15.27,1:45:18.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一着陆 我们就炸了楼顶
Dialogue: 1,1:45:18.24,1:45:23.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等他们查出原因 我们已经在海滩上吃红利了
Dialogue: 1,1:45:29.46,1:45:30.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:45:31.07,1:45:32.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍尔?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:32.93,1:45:34.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 鲍尔 你有空吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:36.50,1:45:38.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿 约翰
Dialogue: 1,1:45:39.94,1:45:43.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 伙计 我现在有一种 不祥的感觉
Dialogue: 1,1:45:43.55,1:45:45.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你帮我一个忙
Dialogue: 1,1:45:48.38,1:45:52.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…请你去找我的妻子 别问我怎么找 到时候你会知道的
Dialogue: 1,1:45:54.42,1:45:59.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你帮我转告她 我想请你告诉她…
Dialogue: 1,1:46:06.00,1:46:08.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她我现在才知道
Dialogue: 1,1:46:08.74,1:46:10.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真是个混蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:46:11.41,1:46:12.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 1,1:46:14.34,1:46:15.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在她…
Dialogue: 1,1:46:19.21,1:46:21.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在她获得大好机会的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:46:22.02,1:46:26.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我本应该去支持她
Dialogue: 1,1:46:26.52,1:46:27.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 1,1:46:28.92,1:46:32.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让她无後顾之忧
Dialogue: 1,1:46:34.60,1:46:35.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的
Dialogue: 1,1:46:38.53,1:46:40.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉她
Dialogue: 1,1:46:41.54,1:46:46.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对我这样的流浪汉 她简直就是一种恩赐
Dialogue: 1,1:46:48.04,1:46:51.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她曾听我说过一千遍“我爱你”
Dialogue: 1,1:46:52.65,1:46:56.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,却从未听我说“对不起”
Dialogue: 1,1:46:56.68,1:47:02.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你帮我告诉她 约翰说对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:47:04.29,1:47:05.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:06.29,1:47:07.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:07.56,1:47:09.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是 我听见了 约翰
Dialogue: 1,1:47:11.17,1:47:13.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以自己去跟她说
Dialogue: 1,1:47:14.07,1:47:18.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你小心 肯定能活着出来 你明白吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:18.24,1:47:20.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我想这得问问楼上的人
Dialogue: 1,1:47:24.01,1:47:25.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:26.31,1:47:27.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:28.25,1:47:31.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在楼上搞什么鬼 汉斯?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:33.42,1:47:34.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰!
Dialogue: 1,1:47:34.52,1:47:37.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 艾尔 听着 过会儿再和你聊
Dialogue: 1,1:47:39.66,1:47:42.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在得去查看一下
Dialogue: 1,1:47:45.20,1:47:47.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一分钟!我只要一分钟
Dialogue: 1,1:47:47.80,1:47:49.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只和他们谈一分钟
Dialogue: 1,1:47:49.74,1:47:51.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不许生人进来
Dialogue: 1,1:47:51.87,1:47:54.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 退後 走!走!
Dialogue: 1,1:47:54.34,1:47:58.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你让我进去 否则我就找移民局
Dialogue: 1,1:48:01.12,1:48:06.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这也许是孩子们最後一次 和他们的父母说话
Dialogue: 1,1:48:07.32,1:48:08.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:08.76,1:48:10.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 过来
Dialogue: 1,1:48:21.04,1:48:22.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 汉斯?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:23.17,1:48:24.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:47.26,1:48:50.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 圣母玛丽亚
Dialogue: 1,1:48:53.87,1:48:56.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍尔 鲍尔! 听我说!
Dialogue: 1,1:48:56.57,1:48:58.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是圈套! 整个大厦的顶层全是…
Dialogue: 1,1:49:00.91,1:49:01.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:04.35,1:49:05.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:06.21,1:49:07.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 回话!
Dialogue: 1,1:49:08.12,1:49:09.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:09.22,1:49:12.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是什么圈套
Dialogue: 1,1:49:12.32,1:49:14.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这还用你说
Dialogue: 1,1:49:20.33,1:49:22.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是高手
Dialogue: 1,1:49:24.70,1:49:26.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是私人恩怨
Dialogue: 1,1:49:50.09,1:49:52.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了
Dialogue: 1,1:49:52.93,1:49:54.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,直昇机来了
Dialogue: 1,1:49:54.86,1:49:58.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的人集中起来 吉奈萝小姐
Dialogue: 1,1:49:58.33,1:50:02.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的爸爸妈妈非常重要
Dialogue: 1,1:50:02.47,1:50:04.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们很勇敢
Dialogue: 1,1:50:04.54,1:50:08.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么话要告诉他们吗? 他们正看着呢
Dialogue: 1,1:50:08.54,1:50:11.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧
Dialogue: 1,1:50:20.19,1:50:21.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连太太
Dialogue: 1,1:50:24.76,1:50:28.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴和您见面
Dialogue: 1,1:50:31.33,1:50:33.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都给我站起来!到楼顶去!
Dialogue: 1,1:50:33.40,1:50:36.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们锁在那儿然後回来!
Dialogue: 1,1:51:04.87,1:51:09.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该听听你兄弟的惨叫! 当我拧断他脖子的时候!
Dialogue: 1,1:51:12.57,1:51:14.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你估计会有多少损失?
Dialogue: 1,1:51:15.01,1:51:20.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们干掉恐怖分子 会损失20%到25%的人质
Dialogue: 1,1:51:21.02,1:51:23.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个可以接受
Dialogue: 1,1:51:23.55,1:51:25.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把机枪藏在飞机里面
Dialogue: 1,1:51:25.42,1:51:28.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要伪装成运输机 而不是攻击机
Dialogue: 1,1:51:40.47,1:51:42.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!跟上!快点!
Dialogue: 1,1:51:42.40,1:51:43.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快!快走!
Dialogue: 1,1:51:44.04,1:51:45.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快一点!
Dialogue: 1,1:51:46.51,1:51:47.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快走!快一点!
Dialogue: 1,1:51:51.65,1:51:52.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,西奥
Dialogue: 1,1:51:53.11,1:51:54.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的红利
Dialogue: 1,1:51:54.82,1:51:56.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你坐下
Dialogue: 1,1:51:56.88,1:51:59.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个警察的妻子也许有点用
Dialogue: 1,1:51:59.69,1:52:02.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连 我有个消息告诉你
Dialogue: 1,1:52:03.22,1:52:04.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:16.00,1:52:17.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快走!跟上!
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.94,1:52:20.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快走!
Dialogue: 1,1:52:33.55,1:52:35.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋!我要杀了你!
Dialogue: 1,1:52:39.76,1:52:40.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:41.30,1:52:43.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去开车? - 去开车
Dialogue: 1,1:52:50.54,1:52:54.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,摆了那么多姿态 说了那么多废话
Dialogue: 1,1:52:54.68,1:52:57.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不过就是个小贼
Dialogue: 1,1:52:57.25,1:52:59.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是寻常的贼 麦克连太太
Dialogue: 1,1:52:59.85,1:53:04.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我现在是绑架者 就请你礼貌一点!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:10.59,1:53:12.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋!我要杀了你!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:12.79,1:53:16.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要煮了你 然後再吃掉!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:38.89,1:53:40.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢这样
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.60,1:53:54.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就像他妈的西贡 嘿 小子?
Dialogue: 1,1:53:56.14,1:53:59.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我在念初中 笨蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:54:26.93,1:54:28.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:28.44,1:54:29.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉·吉奈萝在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:30.00,1:54:32.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉·吉奈萝! 荷莉在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:32.21,1:54:34.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉在哪儿?她在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:34.14,1:54:35.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她被抓走了! - 在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:35.48,1:54:36.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在金库!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:36.64,1:54:38.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 金库在哪儿? - 在第30层!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:38.98,1:54:40.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,楼梯上面 她被抓走了
Dialogue: 1,1:54:41.08,1:54:43.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,到楼下去!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:43.28,1:54:46.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个楼顶就要爆炸啦!快下去!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:46.59,1:54:49.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快下去!快他妈的下去!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:51.36,1:54:54.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们发现了 探员们 一名恐怖分子在射击
Dialogue: 1,1:54:54.30,1:54:56.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了!向左飞
Dialogue: 1,1:55:02.27,1:55:03.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 杀了那个混蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:55:12.08,1:55:15.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你们一夥的 混蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:55:15.22,1:55:18.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!再转回去! 我要收拾这个杂种!
Dialogue: 1,1:55:37.24,1:55:39.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你他妈的…
Dialogue: 1,1:55:41.04,1:55:43.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 约翰 你他妈的到这来干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:44.01,1:55:46.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的怎么这么倒霉?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:56.89,1:56:00.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有点不对头!他们又回来了!
Dialogue: 1,1:56:00.39,1:56:02.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 炸掉屋顶 - 可卡尔还在上面!
Dialogue: 1,1:56:02.66,1:56:04.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,炸掉屋顶!
Dialogue: 1,1:56:07.34,1:56:10.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 我以後再也不想…
Dialogue: 1,1:56:10.30,1:56:13.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,登上任何高楼大厦
Dialogue: 1,1:56:16.61,1:56:18.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊 千万别让我死!
Dialogue: 1,1:57:50.60,1:57:53.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪!
Dialogue: 1,1:57:54.28,1:57:56.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想联邦调查局 得再派一些人来了!
Dialogue: 1,1:58:09.66,1:58:11.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈的混蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:58:37.92,1:58:40.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他妈的怎么回事?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:42.36,1:58:47.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎么样? 坐在这儿看着大楼倒下去吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:54.30,1:58:55.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:58:55.27,1:58:57.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦!好吧!
Dialogue: 1,1:58:58.57,1:58:59.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿！嘿！
Dialogue: 1,1:59:00.74,1:59:02.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 宝贝
Dialogue: 1,1:59:02.64,1:59:04.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持 宝贝
Dialogue: 1,1:59:05.28,1:59:06.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 1,1:59:51.43,1:59:53.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,汉斯!
Dialogue: 1,2:00:07.64,2:00:09.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪
Dialogue: 1,2:00:09.51,2:00:12.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨，亲爱的
Dialogue: 1,2:00:33.80,2:00:37.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们来就是为了这个? 他妈的抢劫?
Dialogue: 1,2:00:38.24,2:00:39.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 1,2:00:41.14,2:00:43.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要炸掉整座大楼 汉斯?
Dialogue: 1,2:00:43.54,2:00:46.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你偷了六百块 你可以马上消失
Dialogue: 1,2:00:46.65,2:00:49.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你偷的是六亿 他们肯定能找到你
Dialogue: 1,2:00:49.75,2:00:52.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,除非他们认为你已经死了
Dialogue: 1,2:00:52.09,2:00:54.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 1,2:01:04.70,2:01:06.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他是我的
Dialogue: 1,2:01:09.64,2:01:11.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了
Dialogue: 1,2:01:11.57,2:01:14.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还是牛仔作风 麦克连先生
Dialogue: 1,2:01:14.44,2:01:16.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,美国人都一样
Dialogue: 1,2:01:16.18,2:01:20.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过这次韦恩别想 和凯丽一起出去看落日了
Dialogue: 1,2:01:20.21,2:01:22.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是古柏 笨蛋
Dialogue: 1,2:01:22.12,2:01:23.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,玩笑开够了
Dialogue: 1,2:01:24.02,2:01:26.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也能成为好牛仔 汉斯
Dialogue: 1,2:01:26.99,2:01:31.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是的 你以前对我是怎么说的
Dialogue: 1,2:01:31.73,2:01:35.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的 王八蛋
Dialogue: 1,2:01:56.65,2:01:57.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,2:02:03.22,2:02:04.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,旅途愉快 汉斯
Dialogue: 1,2:02:49.40,2:02:51.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,希望那不是一名人质
Dialogue: 1,2:03:27.34,2:03:29.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这边 这个角度更好
Dialogue: 1,2:03:29.98,2:03:31.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,帮他们一把
Dialogue: 1,2:03:33.65,2:03:36.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,继续走 继续走
Dialogue: 1,2:03:41.76,2:03:45.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快 我们要错过了 - 好 把笔记本给我
Dialogue: 1,2:04:08.38,2:04:12.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在那里怎么样？他们怎么对待你？
Dialogue: 1,2:04:58.70,2:05:00.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我太太 荷莉
Dialogue: 1,2:05:00.50,2:05:02.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉·吉奈萝
Dialogue: 1,2:05:03.20,2:05:04.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉·麦克连
Dialogue: 1,2:05:05.04,2:05:06.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 荷莉
Dialogue: 1,2:05:06.81,2:05:08.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你选了一个好丈夫
Dialogue: 1,2:05:08.84,2:05:10.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要好好照顾他
Dialogue: 1,2:05:11.48,2:05:12.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连
Dialogue: 1,2:05:13.25,2:05:15.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连 我要听你的解释! 我要你的解释!
Dialogue: 1,2:05:15.88,2:05:18.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须回答一些问题 先生
Dialogue: 1,2:05:18.65,2:05:20.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死艾利斯是一件
Dialogue: 1,2:05:20.45,2:05:24.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,财产损失、妨碍警方公务
Dialogue: 1,2:06:04.56,2:06:07.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事啦!你们两个进去看看 还有没有别的人
Dialogue: 1,2:06:18.41,2:06:21.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这是自己人!
Dialogue: 1,2:06:30.96,2:06:32.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克连先生 麦克连先生!
Dialogue: 1,2:06:32.63,2:06:37.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都结束了 经过这些折磨 你有什么感想?
Dialogue: 1,2:06:42.50,2:06:43.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看谁来了
Dialogue: 1,2:06:45.01,2:06:48.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 圣诞快乐 阿盖 - 圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 1,2:06:51.81,2:06:52.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你拍下来了?
Dialogue: 1,2:06:55.42,2:06:58.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这就是他们的圣诞节 我明年一定还来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:10.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:20.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:00:57.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't like flying, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What gives you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:08.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna know the secret to surviving air travel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,After you get where you're going, take off your shoes and socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:15.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you walk around on the rug barefoot and make fists with your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fists with your toes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:23.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. It sounds crazy. Trust me. I've been doing it for nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.01,0:01:27.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir! Better than a shower and a hot cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:41.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's OK. I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:47.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Trust me. I've been doing this for 11 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:52.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The captain and the crew would like to welcome you to Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.40,0:01:55.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Have a very merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:02.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:07.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Flight 247 to Tucson now boarding at gate 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:14.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Flight 247 to Tucson now boarding at gate 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:47.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:51.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to congratulate all of you for making this one of the greatest years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:54.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in the history of the Nakatomi Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:03.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,On behalf of the Chief Executive Officer, Mr Ozu, and the Board of Directors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:07.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we thank you all and wish you a merry Christmas and a happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:11.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas! Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:15.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Holly. What about dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:17.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Harry, it's Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Families, stockings...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:24.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Chestnuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:28.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Rudolph and Frosty? Any of these things ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:33.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I was thinking more of mulled wine, a nice, aged Brie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:37.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and a roaring fireplace. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:43.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginny, it's 5:40. Join the party. Have some champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:46.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're making me feel like Ebenezer Scrooge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:49.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. Do you think the baby can handle a little sip?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:53.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That baby's ready to tend bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:54.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane residence. Lucy McClane speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:09.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Lucy McClane. This is your mother speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:13.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy! When are you coming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:17.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty soon. You'll be in bed when I get there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:19.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me talk to Paulina, OK, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:24.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And no snooping around the house looking for presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Daddy coming home with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:30.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we'll see what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa and Mommy can do, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put Paulina on. Bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Paulina!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:44.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hola, Mrs Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:47.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Mr McClane call?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Mrs Holly. No telefono.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He probably didn't have time before his flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It might be a good idea to make up the spare bedroom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:57.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Si, Mrs Holly. I do that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:04.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What would I do without you, Paulina?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,California!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I'm John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:48.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Argyle. I'm your limo driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:53.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:06:01.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,OK... Argyle. What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:06.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was hoping you could tell me. It's my first time driving a limo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:09.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's OK. It's my first time riding in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:12.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Relax. We got everything in this mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:15.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this... CD, CB, TV,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,telephone, full bar, VHS.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:25.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If your friend's hot to trot, I know a few mama bears we can hook up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:28.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Or is he married? - He's married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:37.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that. It's the girl's day off. I didn't know you were gonna sit up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your lady live out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:41.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,About the past six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Meaning you still live in New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:48.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You always ask this many questions, Argyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:52.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I used to drive a cab and people would expect a little chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:56.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- So, you divorced? - Just drive the car, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:07:00.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on. You divorced? You separated? She beat you up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:07.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She had a good job. It turned into a great career.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That meant she had to move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:15.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- You're very fast, Argyle. - So, why didn't you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:21.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well? Why didn't you come with her? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I'm a New York cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:26.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a backlog of scumbags I'm still trying to put behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can'tjust go that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:31.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You thought she wasn't gonna make it here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:35.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and she'd come crawling back to you so why bother to pack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said, you're very fast, Argyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if we hear some tunes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:46.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you got any Christmas music?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:53.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Christmas music.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:25.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So your lady sees you, you run into her arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:28.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the music comes up and you live happily ever after, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:35.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So, if it doesn't work out, you got a place to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:38.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:44.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I tell you what. I'll wait in the parking garage. You score, give me a call on the car phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:48.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take your bags to the desk. You strike out, I'll get you a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:53.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- You're all right, Argyle. - Remember that when you sign for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to see Holly McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just type it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cute toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:35.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, if you have to take a leak, it'll even help you find your zipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thirtieth floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:02.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The party. They're the only ones left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:06.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take the express elevator. Get off where you hear the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:07.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:08.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Champagne, sir? - Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:44.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:47.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuckin' California!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:03.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi. I'm looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Holly Gennero. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you must be John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Joe Takagi. How was your ride in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.65,0:12:12.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice. I have you to thank for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Seemed the least we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:15.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Quite a place you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:20.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It will be if we get it finished. Still several floors under construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.39,0:12:24.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly went to fax some documents. She should be back any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:26.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In the meanwhile, her office is back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:30.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:35.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was making a call. This was the nearest phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:38.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to meet John McClane,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly's policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis is in charge of international development.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You missed some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:52.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.49,0:12:55.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Food? Cake? Some watered-down champagne?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, thank you. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:00.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You throw quite a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't realize they celebrated Christmas in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:09.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're flexible. Pearl Harbor didn't work out, so we got you with tape decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:16.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sort of a double celebration. We closed a pretty big deal today
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and a lot of it was due to Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:21.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be out in a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:26.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you met everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been sticking him with spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:40.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She was made for the business. Tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was hoping you made that flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Show him the watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:48.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:52.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Show him. Are you embarrassed? It's a small token of appreciation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:55.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,for all her hard work. It's a Rolex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure I'll see it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:14:01.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a place where I could wash up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.33,0:14:02.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:22.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to forgive Ellis. He gets very depressed this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:26.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He thought he was God's greatest gift, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:28.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's got his eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:35.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's OK. I have my eye on his private bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:38.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you staying? Things happened so fast
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:41.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't get a chance to ask you on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:44.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cappy Roberts retired out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:49.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- He said I could bunk with him. - Cappy retired, huh? Where's he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Romona.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:52.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pomona.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pomona.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:57.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Pomona. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be in the car half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:05.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't we make it easy? I have a spare bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:08.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not huge or anything, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:11.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the kids would love to have you at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They would, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I would, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:24.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:43.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't miss my name, though, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:46.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Except maybe when you're signing checks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Since when did you start using Ms Gennero?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:55.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a Japanese company. They figure a married woman's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You are a married woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:02.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- This conversation again? - We never finished this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:08.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I had an opportunity. I had to take it. - No matter what it did to our marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.39,0:16:12.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- It changed your idea of our marriage. - You have no clue what my idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:16.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know exactly what your idea of our marriage should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:18.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms Gennero, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:29.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Takagi is looking for you. He wants you to say something to the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:30.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Speech time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:39.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Be back in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:52.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That was great, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:55.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good job. Very mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:50.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So Kareem rebounds. Feeds Worthy on the break, over to AC, to Magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,then back to Worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Boom! Two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:17:59.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:13.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:14.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fists with your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.43,0:21:46.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Argyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:48.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:49.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:52.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Down at the garage. What's with you and your lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The vote's not in yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Argyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:30.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mac, you there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.55,0:22:41.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You know the number. Use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.77,0:24:16.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay calm. Everything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:39.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.74,0:24:43.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:45.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.76,0:25:04.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.83,0:25:07.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.80,0:25:19.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Due to the Nakatomi Corporation's legacy of greed around the globe
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.17,0:25:23.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they're about to be taught a lesson in the real use of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.48,0:25:26.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You will be witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.88,0:25:29.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:32.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where is Mr Takagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.49,0:25:38.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Joseph Yashinobo Takagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:42.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,born Kyoto, 1937.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:44.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:48.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Family emigrated to San Pedro, California, 1939,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.90,0:25:54.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,interned at Manzanar, 1942 to '43,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.78,0:25:59.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,scholarship student, University of California,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:01.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,1955.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:09.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Law degree, Stanford, 1962.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.49,0:26:13.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,MBA, Harvard, 1970.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.43,0:26:17.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,President, Nakatomi Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.80,0:26:21.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Vice Chairman, Nakatomi Investment Group...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:22.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And father
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.61,0:26:26.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,of five.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:28.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Takagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:32.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.85,0:26:34.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:50.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,32... construction, 33... computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.51,0:27:05.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.85,0:27:07.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John Phillips, London.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.32,0:27:12.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I have two myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.05,0:27:16.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Rumor has it Arafat buys his there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.89,0:27:23.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- This way? - On the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:49.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,"And when Alexander saw the breadth of his domain
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.52,0:27:53.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,he wept, for there were no more worlds to conquer."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.93,0:28:00.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The benefits of a classical education.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.84,0:28:04.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.61,0:28:09.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I always enjoyed to make models when I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.38,0:28:14.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The exactness, the attention to every conceivable detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.98,0:28:16.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:21.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this what this is all about? Our project in Indonesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:24.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Contrary to what you people may think,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:27.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we're going to develop that region, not exploit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.36,0:28:31.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe you. I read the article in Forbes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:35.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Takagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.07,0:28:40.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I could talk about industrialization and men's fashions all day
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:42.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm afraid work must intrude
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:46.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and my associate here has some questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.98,0:28:49.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sort of fill-in-the-blanks questions, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.39,0:29:01.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have that code.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.23,0:29:05.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You broke in here to access our computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.97,0:29:09.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Any information you get, when they wake up in Tokyo, they'll change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.27,0:29:12.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be able to blackmail our executives...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.27,0:29:14.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit... down!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:28.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Takagi, I'm really not interested in your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.09,0:29:35.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But I need the code key
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.70,0:29:40.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,because I am interested in the $640 million
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.20,0:29:44.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in negotiable bearer bonds that you have locked in your vault
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.67,0:29:48.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the computer controls the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.51,0:29:51.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You want money?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.95,0:29:54.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of terrorists are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.62,0:30:00.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who said we were terrorists?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.57,0:30:22.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The bonds represent, at most,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:26.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,10 days' operating capital for your parent organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.31,0:30:29.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really no more than a temporary inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.72,0:30:30.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.15,0:30:36.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The code, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.26,0:30:41.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's useless to you. There are seven safeguards on our vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.56,0:30:44.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The code key's only one of them. You won't get it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.33,0:30:47.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then there's no reason not to tell it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.73,0:30:51.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I told you. - It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.28,0:30:59.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a very nice suit, Mr Takagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:03.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It would be a shame to ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:08.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to count to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.52,0:31:12.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There will not be a four.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.99,0:31:15.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:17.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:21.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,two,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- three... - I don't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.61,0:31:28.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on ajet to Tokyo and ask the chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.94,0:31:30.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll just have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.18,0:31:31.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We do it the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.45,0:31:39.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tony, dispose of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:42.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Karl, check on Heinrich up on the machine floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.28,0:32:09.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.15,0:32:11.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See to Heinrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:14.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.25,0:32:17.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you can break the code?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.39,0:32:22.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't bring me along for my charming personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.03,0:32:32.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Argyle, tell me you heard the shots. You're calling the police right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.61,0:32:36.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'm still coming by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.31,0:32:39.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweetheart, have I ever lied to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.25,0:32:41.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My boss thinks I'm on my way to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.05,0:32:45.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Uli, get up on the pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.29,0:32:48.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Marco, you go through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.26,0:32:51.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll throw you the cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.03,0:32:57.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans, we're on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.04,0:33:12.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.85,0:33:17.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Uli.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:25.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,30 minutes to break the code,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.93,0:33:31.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,two hours, two and a half hours for the five mechanicals, at the minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.36,0:33:34.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The 7th lock, however, is out of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.19,0:33:58.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.69,0:34:02.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The 7th lock... the electromagnetic seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:04.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The circuits cannot be cut locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.40,0:34:07.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.47,0:34:12.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why the fuck didn't you stop him, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.61,0:34:16.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause then you'd be dead, too, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:18.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Think, goddamn it! Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.92,0:34:32.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got a fire alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.23,0:34:34.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.99,0:34:38.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give them the guard's name and cancel the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.10,0:34:40.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then disable the sys...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.80,0:34:46.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eddie, on what floor did the alarm go off?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.24,0:34:50.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.96,0:35:04.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:07.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, baby. Come to Papa. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.06,0:35:12.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.00,0:35:14.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.23,0:35:18.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, baby. Come to Papa. I'll kiss your fuckin' Dalmatian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.94,0:35:23.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You stupid motherfuckers! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.81,0:35:25.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Turn the fuckin' truck around!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.21,0:36:02.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The fire has been called off, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.89,0:36:09.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No one is coming to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.29,0:36:16.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You might as well come out and join the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.20,0:36:21.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.83,0:36:53.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Drop it, dickhead. It's the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.90,0:36:57.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.77,0:36:59.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Because you're a policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.74,0:37:02.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There are rules for policemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.24,0:37:05.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's what my captain keeps telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.43,0:38:10.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.12,0:38:12.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.41,0:38:14.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bet your ass I wish to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.89,0:38:56.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nine million terrorists in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.96,0:39:00.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I gotta kill one with feet smaller than my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.48,0:39:54.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted this to be professional, efficient, adult, cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.21,0:39:56.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not a lot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.12,0:39:58.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Takagi did not see it that way
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.42,0:40:02.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so he won't be joining us for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.22,0:40:06.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We can go any way you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:10.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can walk out of here or be carried out
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.30,0:40:14.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but have no illusions... we are in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.83,0:40:19.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So... decide now, each of you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.91,0:40:21.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and please remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.31,0:40:25.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we have left nothing to chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.79,0:40:35.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.96,0:40:47.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,"Now I have a machine gun".
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.30,0:40:52.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,HO-HO-HO.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.31,0:40:57.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A security guard we missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.38,0:41:02.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're usually tired, old policemen. No, this is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.16,0:41:14.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to do something, Hans.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:15.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.69,0:41:20.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell Karl his brother is dead. Tell him to come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.17,0:41:27.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Franco, Fritz, take the body upstairs and out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.94,0:41:31.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want the hostages to think too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.04,0:42:36.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.88,0:42:39.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll have it, but let Heinrich plant the detonators
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.05,0:42:42.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and Theo prepare the vault. After we call the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.72,0:42:45.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you can tear the building apart looking for this man
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.02,0:42:48.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but, until then, do not alter the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.29,0:42:51.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And if he alters it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.33,0:42:58.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.20,0:43:02.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.40,0:43:03.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.64,0:43:08.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- John. - John?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.44,0:43:11.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He can fuck this up. What does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.01,0:43:13.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,His job.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.35,0:43:17.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bullshit. His job's 3,000 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:21.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Without him, we still have a chance to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.45,0:43:23.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell that to Takagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.36,0:43:49.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mayday, anyone copying channel nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.80,0:43:53.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Terrorists have seized the Nakatomi building and are holding 30 people hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.90,0:43:56.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I repeat. Unknown number of terrorists,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.10,0:43:59.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,six or more armed with automatic weapons at Nakatomi Plaza,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.54,0:44:00.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Century City.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.61,0:44:03.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the best place to transmit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.58,0:44:04.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.21,0:44:05.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.32,0:44:10.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same address as that fire signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.99,0:44:13.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.89,0:44:19.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, whoever you are, this channel is reserved for emergency calls only.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.33,0:44:22.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No fucking shit, lady! Do I sound like I'm ordering a pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.38,0:44:38.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No one kills him but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.78,0:44:40.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They have already killed one hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.02,0:44:44.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They are fortifying their positions while you're jerkin' me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.62,0:44:48.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, I've already told you. This is a reserved channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.39,0:44:52.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If this is an emergency call, dial 911 on your telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.19,0:44:55.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, I'll report this as an FCC violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.93,0:44:59.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! Come down here and arrest me! Just send the police now!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.41,0:45:16.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See if a black and white can drive by.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.76,0:45:32.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thought you guys just ate doughnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:34.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're for my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.17,0:45:38.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.04,0:45:40.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bag it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.48,0:45:43.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.65,0:45:48.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.22,0:45:53.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dispatch to 8-Lincoln-30. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.72,0:45:55.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is 8-Lincoln-30.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.79,0:46:00.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Investigate a code two at Nakatomi Plaza, Century City.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.13,0:46:04.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,8-Lincoln-30 to Dispatch. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.32,0:48:03.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.23,0:48:21.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit! Where the fuck is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.42,0:48:45.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.24,0:49:03.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's in the elevator shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.01,0:49:07.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect. The elevators are locked off. He can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.52,0:49:09.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut him in and come back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.19,0:49:14.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.23,0:49:23.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Karl, the police are probably on their way already.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.03,0:49:24.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Karl?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.05,0:49:46.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.13,0:49:54.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can stall them, but not if they hear gunshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.53,0:49:57.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you lock him in, he'll be neutralized...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.06,0:51:05.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,"Come out to the coast! We'll get together, have a few laughs."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.64,0:51:15.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I know what a TV dinner feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.67,0:52:27.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.36,0:53:14.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.67,0:53:22.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No signs of disturbance, Dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.27,0:53:23.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger. Possible crank call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.97,0:53:25.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Check the area again and confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.28,0:53:34.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's driving this car? Stevie Wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I do see a guard inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.32,0:53:41.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna go in for a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.19,0:53:42.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Use caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.79,0:53:46.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.26,0:53:49.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I had a feelin' you'd be callin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.05,0:54:15.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Evenin', officer. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.07,0:54:28.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We had that false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.07,0:54:33.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You ask me, that computer sent you on another wild-goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.34,0:54:36.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They been chasing bugs in this system ever since they installed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.91,0:54:39.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...Notre Dame on top of USC.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.28,0:54:41.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aw, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.12,0:54:43.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got 50 bucks bet on them assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.42,0:54:49.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, come on, where's the fucking cavalry?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.45,0:55:17.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.65,0:55:19.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.12,0:55:24.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,27 seconds left in this first period. Seven to nothing, Notre Dame.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.43,0:55:28.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll put this fuckin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.03,0:55:30.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze, motherfucker! Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.73,0:55:31.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.93,0:55:34.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Put the gun down! - OK! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.80,0:55:35.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Drop that fuckin' gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.27,0:55:37.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Marco, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.02,0:55:56.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,To hell with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.07,0:56:06.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You are done!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.00,0:56:10.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No more table! Where are you going, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.11,0:56:14.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you have a chance to kill someone, don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.82,0:56:23.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.08,0:56:27.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sorry to waste your time. - No problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.62,0:56:30.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Merry Christmas. - Merry Christmas to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.54,0:56:46.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, for the love...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.91,0:56:51.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,8-Lincoln-30 to Dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.75,0:56:52.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.91,0:56:57.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A wild-goose chase at Nakatomi Plaza. Everything here's OK. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.16,0:57:07.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.23,0:57:08.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Goddamn it! Jesus H Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.04,0:57:18.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the party, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.15,0:57:29.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get someone here now, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.25,0:57:31.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Policeman under automatic rifle fire at Nakatomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.89,0:57:33.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need backup assistance now!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.26,0:57:36.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, goddamn it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.18,0:57:57.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Monica, I can get us a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.28,0:58:00.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wolfgang and I are very close friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.38,0:58:03.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I interviewed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.92,0:58:07.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. Officer needs assistance at...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.69,0:58:11.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm at Nakatomi Plaza. They're turning my car into Swiss cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.43,0:58:15.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need backup assistance now! Now, goddamn it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.38,0:58:38.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Never thought I'd love to hear that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.65,0:58:43.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All of you relax. This is a matter of inconvenient timing, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.16,0:58:47.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Police action was inevitable... and, as it happens, necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.00,0:58:51.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So, let them fumble about outside and stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.53,0:58:53.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is simply the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.84,0:58:58.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you all I wanted radio silence until...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.41,0:59:01.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry, Hans. I didn't get that message.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.18,0:59:04.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you should have put it on a bulletin board.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.61,0:59:07.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I figured since I waxed Tony and Marco and his friend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.21,0:59:10.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I figured you and Karl and Franco might be lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.15,0:59:12.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so I wanted to give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.19,0:59:14.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How does he know so much about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.82,0:59:17.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.39,0:59:21.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I assume you are our mysterious party crasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.06,0:59:23.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You are most troublesome
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.50,0:59:25.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,for a security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.50,0:59:28.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Hans. Wrong guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.64,0:59:31.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to go for double jeopardy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.51,0:59:38.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These are very bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.78,0:59:41.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.38,0:59:43.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just the fly in the ointment, Hans.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.72,0:59:45.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The monkey in the wrench,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.22,0:59:47.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.33,0:59:54.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Check on all the others. Don't use the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.90,0:59:59.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See if he's lying about Marco and find out if anyone else is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.67,1:00:04.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Mystery Guest,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.87,1:00:07.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.34,1:00:10.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm still here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.08,1:00:12.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,unless you want to open the front door for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.91,1:00:14.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm afraid not,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.92,1:00:17.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you have me at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:19.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You know my name, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.62,1:00:23.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just another American who saw too many movies as a child?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.89,1:00:27.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Another orphan of a bankrupt culture
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.13,1:00:30.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,who thinks he's John Wayne, Rambo, Marshal Dillon?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.53,1:00:34.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was always partial to Roy Rogers, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.10,1:00:36.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I liked those sequined shirts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.94,1:00:40.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think you have a chance against us, Mr Cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.31,1:00:45.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yippee-ki-yay, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.42,1:00:51.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll beat everyone if I get a remote.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.59,1:00:53.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sam, I don't have the new pages.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.49,1:00:55.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Harvey, keep your pants on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.79,1:00:57.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sam, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.66,1:01:00.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Simon's with the remote. I'll tell him to swing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.96,1:01:02.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't sit on this!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.86,1:01:05.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my story! I'm going out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.73,1:01:07.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Sam. Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.47,1:01:09.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't give me a truck, I'll steal a truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.74,1:01:12.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Give us a break, Thornburg. - Eat it, Harvey!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.27,1:01:14.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...four, three, two,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.91,1:01:16.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.34,1:01:18.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Harvey, we're on the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.38,1:01:24.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening. This is Harvey Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.35,1:01:30.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm Gail Wallens. This is Nightline News at 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.22,1:01:33.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our top stories on this Christmas Eve...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.13,1:01:36.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take truck number five and get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.10,1:01:47.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He wasn't lying about Marco. He's down on the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.57,1:01:49.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The other man was Heinrich
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.94,1:01:52.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and his bag is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.98,1:01:56.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He had the detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.39,1:02:01.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Theo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.06,1:02:03.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Theo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.79,1:02:07.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We may have some problems. How's our schedule?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.56,1:02:10.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Three down, four to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.20,1:02:11.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then don't waste time
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.60,1:02:13.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.10,1:02:15.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Sergeant Al Powell
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.80,1:02:18.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,of the LA Police Department. If the person who radioed for help
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.01,1:02:22.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,can hear me on this channel, acknowledge this transmission.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.38,1:02:23.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I say again,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.48,1:02:26.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,if the person who radioed for help can hear me,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.88,1:02:29.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,acknowledge this transmission!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.65,1:02:36.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I read you, pal. You the guy in the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.39,1:02:38.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's left of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.43,1:02:40.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you identify yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.19,1:02:41.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not now. Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.96,1:02:46.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen fast. This is a party line. The neighbors got itchy trigger fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.17,1:02:49.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the deal. You got 30 or so hostages on the 30th floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.70,1:02:51.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The leader's name is Hans.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.24,1:02:53.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to shut him up. He's telling them everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.94,1:02:56.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let him. I'm waiting for the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.11,1:02:58.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He can waste as much time as he likes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.31,1:03:00.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but we must find the bag, Fritz.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.68,1:03:02.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They have a freakin'arsenal here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.82,1:03:04.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We must have the detonators.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.25,1:03:08.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They got missiles and enough plastic explosives to orbit Arnold Schwarzenegger.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.42,1:03:12.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're down to nine, counting the skydiver you met.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.33,1:03:17.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These guys are mostly European judging by their clothing labels and...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.57,1:03:25.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.24,1:03:27.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're well-financed and very slick.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.84,1:03:29.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.58,1:03:31.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've seen enough phony IDs in my time
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.45,1:03:35.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to recognize the ones they got must have cost a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.55,1:03:39.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Add all that up, I don't know what the fuck it means
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.05,1:03:43.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you got some bad-ass perpetrators and they're here to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.19,1:03:48.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I hear you, partner. LA's finest are on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.20,1:03:50.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so light 'em if you got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.30,1:03:53.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Way ahead of you, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.60,1:03:55.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So what do I call you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:03:58.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Call me...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.21,1:04:01.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.14,1:04:04.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up, Roy, if you think of anything else
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.98,1:04:06.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,don't be shy, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.21,1:04:09.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In the meantime, find a safe place and let us do your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.32,1:04:12.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all yours, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.04,1:04:31.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's talking to 'em?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.41,1:04:35.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I am, sir. Sergeant Powell. Al Powell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.91,1:04:39.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dwayne Robinson. What's the deal? What do these pricks want?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.01,1:04:42.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you mean the terrorists,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.22,1:04:44.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we haven't heard a peep from them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.38,1:04:46.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who have you been talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.25,1:04:50.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know. He won't give us his name.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.22,1:04:52.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But he appears to be the one who phoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.96,1:04:56.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's killed one terrorist and claims he capped two others.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.26,1:04:57.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He claims?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.60,1:04:59.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Powell, has it occurred to you
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.87,1:05:02.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,he could be one of the terrorists
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.34,1:05:04.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or some nutcase in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.17,1:05:07.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think so. In fact, I think he's a cop,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.34,1:05:10.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,maybe not LAPD, but he's definitely a badge.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.21,1:05:13.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- How do you know that? - A hunch... things he said
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.58,1:05:16.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,like being able to spot a phony ID.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.45,1:05:18.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ, Powell!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.62,1:05:21.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He could be a bartender for all we know!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.19,1:05:22.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,TV's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.66,1:05:25.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.28,1:05:43.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.84,1:05:46.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What idiot put you in charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.28,1:05:48.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You did
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.32,1:05:53.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,when you murdered my boss. Now everybody's looking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.62,1:05:58.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Personally, I'd pass on the job. I don't enjoy being this close to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.70,1:06:08.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.10,1:06:10.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a pregnant woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.14,1:06:13.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Relax. She's not due for a couple of weeks
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.14,1:06:16.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but sitting on that rock isn't doing her any good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.41,1:06:20.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So I would like permission to move her to an office with a sofa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.68,1:06:24.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, but I'll have a sofa brought out. Good enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.68,1:06:26.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.55,1:06:31.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And unless you like it messy, I'd start bringing us in groups to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.29,1:06:35.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You're right. It will be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.50,1:06:37.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Was there something else?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.03,1:06:42.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.07,1:06:51.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Takagi chose his people well, Mrs?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.84,1:06:53.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gennero.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.84,1:06:57.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms Gennero.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.78,1:07:02.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We interrupt this program for a special bulletin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.48,1:07:05.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Richard Thornburg live from Century City.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.45,1:07:11.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight, Los Angeles has joined the sad and worldwide fraternity of cities
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.79,1:07:13.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,whose only membership requirement
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.89,1:07:16.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,is to suffer the anguish of international terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.06,1:07:21.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approximately two hours ago, an unidentified group of men
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.50,1:07:26.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,seized control of the Nakatomi building, sealing off all entrances and exits.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.61,1:07:30.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All telephone lines have been cut and the only communication now possible
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.98,1:07:33.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,has been through the use of CB communicators
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.98,1:07:36.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,which the group brought with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.42,1:07:40.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,According to official sources, the perpetrators of this building siege...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.02,1:07:43.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit five, hold your position.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.02,1:07:48.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got Charlie unit in position by the parking structure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.16,1:07:52.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me ask you... Does this stairway go up to the escalator?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.30,1:07:55.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - Tell them to go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.04,1:07:57.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.44,1:08:00.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it look like? We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.74,1:08:05.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Going in? That's crazy! There could be over 30 hostages in there for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.61,1:08:07.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know shit, Powell.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.61,1:08:11.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's hostages, how come there are no ransom demands?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.12,1:08:14.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's terrorists in there, where's their list of demands?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.45,1:08:16.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All we know is that somebody shot your car up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.79,1:08:18.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably the same silly son of a bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.03,1:08:21.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you've been talking to on that radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.13,1:08:22.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.86,1:08:26.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but what about the body that fell out the window?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.23,1:08:29.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Maybe a stockbroker got depressed. - We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.34,1:08:31.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Light 'em up. Let's go. - Hit your lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.81,1:08:34.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Blue units, go. - Lights on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.62,1:08:48.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Powell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.99,1:08:51.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Powell, you still with me, babe? What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.39,1:08:53.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.83,1:08:57.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here, Roy, but I'm busy right now. I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.63,1:08:58.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Al, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.67,1:09:00.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.43,1:09:02.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you are what I think you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.57,1:09:05.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you'll know when to listen, shut up, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.61,1:09:08.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and when to pray.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.64,1:09:10.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ! You're coming in, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.05,1:09:14.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you what kind of people you're dealing with!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.51,1:09:16.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's load them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.25,1:09:22.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be coming. Everyone get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.62,1:09:26.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Theo, you are the eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.71,1:09:40.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Rivers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.11,1:09:42.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin your reconnoiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.51,1:09:44.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.12,1:09:49.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.64,1:10:10.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.78,1:10:22.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.68,1:10:59.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, spread out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.63,1:11:07.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.01,1:11:26.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.38,1:11:30.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.92,1:11:36.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You macho assholes. No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.76,1:11:42.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Listen up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.96,1:11:46.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,'Twas the night before Christmas
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.23,1:11:48.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and all through the house
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.34,1:11:50.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,not a creature was stirring, except
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.84,1:11:53.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the four assholes coming in the rear in standard
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.87,1:11:55.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,two-by-two cover formation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.15,1:11:59.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.78,1:12:02.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.82,1:12:04.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.25,1:12:05.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.45,1:12:07.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.10,1:12:24.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:26.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're shooting at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.51,1:12:30.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- It's panic fire. They can't see anything. - They're shooting at the lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.82,1:12:38.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going after the lights. Call 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.32,1:12:40.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.82,1:12:42.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mike, burn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.29,1:12:45.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.83,1:12:48.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just wound them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.63,1:12:53.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get them back. They're sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.27,1:12:55.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're almost in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.10,1:12:56.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Send in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.57,1:12:58.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Send in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.35,1:13:12.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.86,1:13:18.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Rivers, Rodriguez, report.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.69,1:13:21.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute. What have we here, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.67,1:13:28.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The police have themselves an RV.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.64,1:13:34.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Southeast corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.05,1:13:49.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.87,1:14:04.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get back! Get the fuck back!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.37,1:14:07.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.71,1:14:44.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I see him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.96,1:15:06.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God! The quarterback is toast!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.57,1:15:10.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on, Rivers. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.40,1:15:12.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hit it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.44,1:15:15.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, you made your point! Let them pull back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.78,1:15:17.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. I'll take it under advisement.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.41,1:15:18.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hit it
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.08,1:15:20.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.09,1:15:35.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.98,1:15:51.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.01,1:15:54.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get them out of the car! They're burning!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.82,1:16:05.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.87,1:16:21.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see you take this under advisement, jerkweed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.21,1:16:27.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Geronimo, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:46.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.17,1:16:53.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're using artillery!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.87,1:16:55.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot, it's not the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.51,1:16:58.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.75,1:17:07.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.36,1:17:13.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My God!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.00,1:17:18.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Tell me you got that. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.33,1:17:22.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eat your heart out, Channel 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.90,1:17:26.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've had an update on the terrorist takeover of the Nakatomi building.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.94,1:17:29.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sources say the terrorist leader, Hans,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.18,1:17:31.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,may be this man... Hans Gruber.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.31,1:17:34.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A member of the radical West German Volksfrei movement.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.31,1:17:38.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Strangely, the Volksfrei leadership issued a communique an hour ago
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.18,1:17:40.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,stating that Gruber had been expelled from that organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.09,1:17:43.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Al, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.52,1:17:44.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.89,1:17:47.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.36,1:17:49.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.80,1:17:52.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember that plastic explosive I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.80,1:17:55.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - There you go. Is the building on fire?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.80,1:17:57.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, but it's gonna need a paintjob
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.70,1:17:59.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and a shitload of screen doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.37,1:18:02.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our spotter said you got two with that blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.21,1:18:04.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Is that him? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.38,1:18:09.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who you think you are
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.15,1:18:11.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you just destroyed a building.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.72,1:18:14.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We do not want your help. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.85,1:18:16.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't want your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.79,1:18:19.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got 100 people down here covered with glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.96,1:18:22.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Glass? Who gives a shit about glass?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.96,1:18:23.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.53,1:18:28.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Deputy Chief of Police Dwayne T Robinson
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.27,1:18:30.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I am in charge of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.34,1:18:32.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're in charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.21,1:18:34.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got some bad news for you, Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.27,1:18:37.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,From up here it doesn't look like you're in charge of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.64,1:18:39.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me, you little asshole...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.85,1:18:40.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Asshole?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.78,1:18:42.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not the one who just got buttfucked
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.62,1:18:44.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,on national TV, Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.89,1:18:47.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me, jerk-off,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.82,1:18:50.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,if you're not part of the solution, you're part of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.89,1:18:54.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit being part of the problem and put the other guy back on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.86,1:18:58.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Roy, how you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.63,1:19:00.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty fucking unappreciated, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.70,1:19:03.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.07,1:19:05.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So do a lot of the other guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.44,1:19:08.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So hang in there, man, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.11,1:19:10.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.61,1:19:14.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, thanks, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.02,1:19:21.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.45,1:19:25.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired of sitting here waiting to see who gets us killed first,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.33,1:19:26.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,them or your husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.93,1:19:28.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.60,1:19:34.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I negotiate million-dollar deals for breakfast. I think I can handle this Eurotrash.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.10,1:19:37.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, sprechen sie talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.07,1:19:39.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd listened to me, he would be neutralized already.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.04,1:19:42.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want neutral. I want dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.14,1:19:45.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hope I'm not interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.14,1:19:46.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.28,1:19:49.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not what I want. It's what I can give you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.36,1:19:59.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, let's be straight, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.96,1:20:04.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's obvious you're not some dumb schmuck up here to snatch a few purses.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.50,1:20:06.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.23,1:20:07.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I watch 60 Minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.97,1:20:10.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I say to myself, these guys are professional,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.74,1:20:13.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they're motivated, they're happening,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.27,1:20:14.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they want something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.94,1:20:17.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't care less about your politics.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.84,1:20:20.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you're pissed off at the camel jockeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.15,1:20:23.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's Northern Ireland. It's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.15,1:20:25.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I figure you're here to negotiate, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:26.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.75,1:20:29.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You figured this all out already?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.19,1:20:31.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, business is business.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.39,1:20:34.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You use a gun, I use a fountain pen. What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.73,1:20:37.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In my terms, you're here on a hostile takeover.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.40,1:20:41.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You grab us for some greenmail but didn't expect a poison pill to be running around.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.10,1:20:43.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.54,1:20:45.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.17,1:20:46.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,bubbee,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.74,1:20:48.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm your white knight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.61,1:20:52.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I must have missed "60 Minutes".
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.38,1:20:54.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.82,1:20:59.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The guy upstairs who's fucking things up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.42,1:21:06.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can give him to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.09,1:21:10.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.23,1:21:14.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roy? Roy, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.84,1:21:18.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just trying to fire down a 1,000-year-old Twinkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.91,1:21:21.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do they put in them?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.84,1:21:26.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sugar-enriched flour, partially hydrogenated vegetable oil,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.85,1:21:28.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,polysorbate 60,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.38,1:21:30.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and yellow dye number five.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.18,1:21:33.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just everything a growing boy needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.72,1:21:35.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How many kids you got, Al?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.66,1:21:39.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,As a matter of fact, my wife is working on our first.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.79,1:21:41.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How about you, cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.53,1:21:44.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got any kids back on your ranch?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.23,1:21:46.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.03,1:21:48.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.53,1:21:52.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure hope I can see them swinging on ajungle gym with Al Jnr someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.14,1:21:56.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, now, that's a date
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.98,1:21:59.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you bring the ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.58,1:22:01.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Touching, cowboy. Touching.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.75,1:22:04.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Or should I call you
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.15,1:22:06.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr McClane?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.59,1:22:10.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr Officer John McClane
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.36,1:22:12.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,of the New York Police Department?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.59,1:22:16.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on the phone to Harry in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.93,1:22:19.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You better get hold of somebody at Dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.40,1:22:23.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sister Theresa called me Mr McClane in the third grade.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.90,1:22:28.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My friends call me John... and you're neither, shithead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.28,1:22:34.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I have someone who wants to talk to you. A very special friend
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.95,1:22:37.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,who was with you at the party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.52,1:22:45.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, John boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.93,1:22:48.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.66,1:22:49.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.06,1:22:54.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, John, they're giving me a few minutes to talk sense into you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.10,1:22:57.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know you think you're doing yourjob
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.27,1:23:02.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you're just dragging this out. No one gets out of here until these guys
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.14,1:23:03.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,can talk to the LA police.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.94,1:23:07.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That won't happen until you stop messing up the works.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.89,1:23:14.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis, what have you told them?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.09,1:23:18.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I told them we were old friends and you were my guest
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.89,1:23:20.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,at the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.39,1:23:23.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis, you shouldn't be doin' this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.46,1:23:25.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.34,1:23:33.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, John, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.07,1:23:36.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell them where the detonators are.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.41,1:23:38.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They know people are listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.75,1:23:42.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They want the detonators, or they're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.29,1:23:47.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John, didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.12,1:23:51.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.09,1:23:56.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John, get with the program! The police are here now. It's their problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.73,1:23:59.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell them where the detonators are!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.37,1:24:02.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm putting my life on the line for you, pal!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.50,1:24:04.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis, listen to me carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.44,1:24:05.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.17,1:24:07.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, Ellis! Just shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.94,1:24:09.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put Hans back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.44,1:24:14.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans, this shithead does not know what kind of man you are but I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.11,1:24:17.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you'll give us what we want and save your friend's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.65,1:24:19.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not part of this equation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.95,1:24:22.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what am I, a method actor?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.36,1:24:25.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Babe, put away the gun. This is radio, not television.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.76,1:24:29.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans, this asshole is not my friend! I don't know him!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.46,1:24:34.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ, Ellis! These people will kill you! Tell them you don't know me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.60,1:24:37.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How can you say that after all these years?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.07,1:24:40.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John? John?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.26,1:25:05.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.20,1:25:09.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to me! Where are my detonators?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.07,1:25:11.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are they, or shall I shoot another one?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.77,1:25:15.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sooner or later, I might get to someone you do care about.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.24,1:25:18.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go fuck yourself, Hans.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.05,1:25:22.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He just let the guy die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.22,1:25:24.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He gave him up. Give me that headset.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.32,1:25:26.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's like pulling the trigger yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.52,1:25:30.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you see what's happening? Can't you read between the lines?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.26,1:25:32.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He did everything he could to save him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.66,1:25:35.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If he gave himself up, they'd both be dead right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.86,1:25:38.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No way, man. They'd be talking to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.63,1:25:42.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You tell this partner of yours to stay out of this from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.20,1:25:45.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Because if he doesn't, I'm really going to nail his ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.84,1:25:49.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The man is hurting. He is alone, tired,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.08,1:25:52.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and he hasn't seen diddly-squat from anybody here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.85,1:25:55.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna tell me he'll give a damn
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.41,1:25:58.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,about what you do to him if he makes it out of there alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.68,1:26:01.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you wake up and smell what you shovelin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.69,1:26:03.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You listen to me, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.32,1:26:06.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Any time you want to go home, you consider yourself dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.09,1:26:10.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, sir. You couldn't drag me away.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.33,1:26:12.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, police.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.37,1:26:15.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, police.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.57,1:26:18.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- This is Sergeant Al Powell... - Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.77,1:26:21.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Deputy Chief Dwayne Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.34,1:26:22.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.34,1:26:24.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Hans Gruber.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.14,1:26:28.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I assume you realize the futility of direct action against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.75,1:26:30.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have no wish for further loss of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.75,1:26:33.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it you do wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.89,1:26:38.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I have comrades in arms around the world languishing in prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.19,1:26:41.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The American State Department enjoys rattling its saber for its own ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.99,1:26:44.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now it can rattle it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.46,1:26:49.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The following people are to be released from their captors.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.74,1:26:52.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In Northern Ireland the seven members of the New Provo Front.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.94,1:26:57.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In Canada, the five imprisoned leaders of Liberte de Quebec.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.68,1:27:01.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In Sri Lanka, the nine members of the Asian Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.71,1:27:03.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.28,1:27:05.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Asian Dawn?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.18,1:27:07.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I read about them in Time magazine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.79,1:27:11.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When these revolutionary brothers and sisters are free,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.79,1:27:14.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the hostages in this building will be taken to the roof
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.09,1:27:19.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and they will accompany us in helicopters to the Los Angeles International Airport
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.83,1:27:22.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where they will be given further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.54,1:27:24.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You have two hours to comply.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.50,1:27:27.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute. Mr. Gruber. This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.04,1:27:31.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the authority. Two hours is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.91,1:27:34.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.25,1:27:39.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get all that? We got to make some calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.52,1:27:41.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think they'll even try?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.75,1:27:43.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.16,1:27:48.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Theo, are we on schedule?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.39,1:27:50.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One more to go, then it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.43,1:27:53.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You better be right, because the last one will take a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.97,1:27:55.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Christmas, Theo.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.57,1:27:58.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the time of miracles, so be of good cheer
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.20,1:28:01.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and call me when you hit the last lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.74,1:28:02.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Karl,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.84,1:28:06.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,hunt that little shit down and get those detonators.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.58,1:28:08.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fritz is checking the explosives.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.81,1:28:11.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll check the explosives. You get the detonators.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.42,1:28:13.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Powell, you out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.29,1:28:17.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here, John. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.19,1:28:20.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You gotta believe me. There was nothing I could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.03,1:28:24.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's gonna be both our asses if you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.86,1:28:26.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.30,1:28:34.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you catch that bullshit Hans was running?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.84,1:28:37.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't make sense, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.68,1:28:42.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me. I'm just a deskjockey who was on my way home when you rang.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.82,1:28:46.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The way you drove that car, I figured you for the street, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.49,1:28:49.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In my youth. In my youth.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.92,1:28:53.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...author of "Hostage Terrorist, Terrorist Hostage:
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.79,1:28:54.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A Study in Duality."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.06,1:28:58.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dr Hasseldorf, what can we expect in the next few hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.86,1:28:59.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Gail,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.49,1:29:02.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,by this time, the hostages should be going through
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.20,1:29:04.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the early stages of the Helsinki Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.53,1:29:06.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,As in Helsinki, Sweden.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.47,1:29:08.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Finland.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.14,1:29:11.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Basically, it's when the hostages and the terrorists
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:14.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,go through a sort of psychological transference
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.54,1:29:16.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and a projection of dependency.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.75,1:29:19.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A strange sort of trust and bond develops.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.68,1:29:22.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've had situations where the hostages
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.35,1:29:24.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,have embraced their captors after release
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.75,1:29:27.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and even corresponded with them in prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.36,1:29:30.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, darling. Asian Dawn. Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.23,1:29:33.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,D-A-W-N.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.26,1:29:34.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sir? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.76,1:29:36.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, the FBI is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.77,1:29:40.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- The FBI is here now? - Yes, sir. Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.67,1:29:41.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.10,1:29:44.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Want a breath mint?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.38,1:29:50.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.85,1:29:53.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Agent Johnson. This is Special Agent Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.55,1:29:56.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, how you doing? - No relation.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.72,1:30:03.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Dwayne Robinson, LAPD. I'm in charge here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.66,1:30:05.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.42,1:31:03.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, there. How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.92,1:31:13.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, God. No. You're one of them, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.16,1:31:14.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.80,1:31:17.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Don't kill me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.77,1:31:20.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't kill me, please! Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.34,1:31:23.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa. Relax. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.17,1:31:24.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.41,1:31:29.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.48,1:31:35.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck are you doin' up here? What were you lookin' for?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.78,1:31:38.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I managed to get out of there and
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.29,1:31:41.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just trying to get up on the roof
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.49,1:31:44.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and see if I could signal for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.69,1:31:47.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's through here. Come and help.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.90,1:31:51.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it. Forget the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.77,1:31:54.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I said forget the roof. They got people all over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.00,1:31:58.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna stay alive, you stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.31,1:32:03.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The best we can figure it,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.45,1:32:06.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we've got maybe 30 or 35 hostages up there,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.02,1:32:08.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,probably on the 30th floor,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.02,1:32:12.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and maybe seven or eight terrorists up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.72,1:32:14.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like an A-7 scenario.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.99,1:32:17.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. We'll handle it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.49,1:32:20.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When we commandeer your men, we'll try and let you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.43,1:32:22.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.46,1:32:23.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Such as?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.53,1:32:25.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What about John McClane?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.27,1:32:28.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the reason we have any information.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.50,1:32:32.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's also the reason you're facing seven terrorists, not twelve.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.21,1:32:34.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's inside? Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.64,1:32:37.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He might be a cop. We're checking on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.65,1:32:40.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- One of yours? - No, no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.85,1:32:46.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You smoke?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.26,1:32:49.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.50,1:32:55.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.57,1:33:02.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't work for Nakatomi.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.74,1:33:09.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And if you're not one of them...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.71,1:33:14.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a cop from New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.05,1:33:16.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,New York?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.72,1:33:17.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.72,1:33:21.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got invited to the Christmas party by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.66,1:33:22.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.53,1:33:35.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Better than being caught with your pants down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.91,1:33:44.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.71,1:33:47.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.58,1:33:49.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Clay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.19,1:33:53.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bill Clay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.69,1:34:01.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Know how to use a handgun, Bill?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.16,1:34:05.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I spent a weekend at a combat ranch.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.23,1:34:07.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That game with the guns that shoot red paint.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.60,1:34:09.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Probably seems kind of stupid to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.24,1:34:12.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.58,1:34:17.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Time for the real thing, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.95,1:34:28.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All you gotta do is pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.92,1:34:29.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.94,1:34:53.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put down the gun and give me my detonators.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.65,1:34:59.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.02,1:35:02.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.09,1:35:05.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put it down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.23,1:35:12.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's pretty tricky with that accent.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.83,1:35:16.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You oughta be on fucking TV with that accent.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.31,1:35:21.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But what do you want with the detonators?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.04,1:35:24.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I already used all the explosives.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.05,1:35:28.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Or did I?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.85,1:35:31.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to count to three.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.52,1:35:33.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Like you did with Takagi?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.69,1:35:39.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No bullets.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.09,1:35:42.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think... I'm fuckin' stupid, Hans?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.26,1:35:43.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.30,1:36:50.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot the glass!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.56,1:37:25.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.33,1:37:57.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Smile, Karl. We're back in business.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.97,1:38:02.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...is the last resort of diplomacy,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.04,1:38:06.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,then couldn't we just as well say
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.17,1:38:09.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that terrorism has an equal claim on being that, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.78,1:38:11.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.01,1:38:15.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane's name, badge number, employment record, vital statistics,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.05,1:38:18.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and his family's home address
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.62,1:38:20.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,right here in LA.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.26,1:38:29.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.63,1:38:31.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.58,1:38:46.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,God, that man looks really pissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.18,1:38:51.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.52,1:38:52.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.89,1:38:56.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Only John can drive somebody that crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.71,1:39:18.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans, heat up that miracle because we just broke through on number six
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.11,1:39:20.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the electromagnetic came down like an anvil.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.88,1:39:26.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Have a look at what our friends outside are doing and I'll be right up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.65,1:39:29.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.89,1:39:32.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John McClane, you still with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.42,1:39:33.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.33,1:39:38.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But all things being equal, I'd rather be in Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.73,1:39:40.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Chalk up two more bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.23,1:39:44.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The boys down here will be glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.87,1:39:46.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got a pool going on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.84,1:39:48.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of odds am I getting?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.77,1:39:50.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.54,1:39:51.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down for 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.08,1:39:53.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm good for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.15,1:39:59.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, pal, you got flat feet?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.32,1:40:04.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell you talking about, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.59,1:40:06.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Something had to get you off the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.13,1:40:08.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.39,1:40:11.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't think a desk job is a noble effort for a cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.57,1:40:14.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.30,1:40:20.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I had an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.41,1:40:22.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The way you drive, I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.77,1:40:23.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.61,1:40:26.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Run over your captain's foot with the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.08,1:40:31.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I shot a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.88,1:40:34.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He was 13 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.95,1:40:39.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it was dark. I couldn't see him. He had a ray gun, looked real enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.30,1:40:46.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When you're a rookie, they teach you everything about being a cop
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.70,1:40:48.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,except how to live with a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.97,1:40:57.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I just couldn't bring myself to draw my gun on anybody again.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.81,1:41:02.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.65,1:41:06.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, man, how could you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.72,1:41:10.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like shit anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.56,1:41:15.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.23,1:41:19.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,DoThe LAPD is not calling the shots down here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.43,1:41:23.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Feds?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.14,1:41:25.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.87,1:41:30.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Those are the city engineers.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.34,1:41:31.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.88,1:41:34.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going into the street circuits.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.68,1:41:36.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The guys in suits, I don't know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.98,1:41:38.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.82,1:41:42.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're ordering the others to cut the building's power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.49,1:41:44.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Regular as clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.36,1:41:47.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Or a time lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.43,1:41:50.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.26,1:41:54.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The circuits that cannot be cut are cut automatically
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.17,1:41:56.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in response to a terrorist incident.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.00,1:41:58.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You asked for miracles, Theo.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.20,1:42:02.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I give you the F-B-I.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.48,1:42:05.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want the building shut down.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.48,1:42:07.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a problem. I got a switch...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.71,1:42:11.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about your switch. I want it out. Dark!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.68,1:42:14.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.32,1:42:16.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, you could. - It can't be done from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.82,1:42:18.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I could... I got the radio...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.59,1:42:22.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do it from here. It's got to be done from downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.13,1:42:26.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've gotta take out a whole city grid. We're talking 10 square blocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.06,1:42:27.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ten blocks? Johnson, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.00,1:42:30.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Christmas Eve. There's thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.67,1:42:32.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to go wider.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.44,1:42:37.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- I need authorization. - How about the United States government?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.61,1:42:39.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lose the grid, or you lose yourjob.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.85,1:42:47.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Central?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.72,1:42:50.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Walt, down at Nakatomi.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.12,1:42:55.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Would it be possible for you to turn off grid 212?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.13,1:42:56.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.36,1:42:59.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I should call the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.10,1:43:02.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No shit it's my ass. I got a big problem here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.27,1:43:04.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut it down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.94,1:43:10.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency lighting activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.78,1:43:13.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Al, talk to me. What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.71,1:43:15.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ask the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.31,1:43:18.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They got the universal terrorist playbook
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.15,1:43:19.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and they're running it step by step.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.72,1:43:24.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gonna go. It's gonna go!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.46,1:43:27.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.72,1:43:52.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.72,1:43:56.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They must be pissing in their pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.96,1:43:58.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The mayor is gonna have my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.15,1:44:22.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.45,1:44:25.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Arrest them for not paying their electric bill?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.58,1:44:27.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've shut them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.42,1:44:30.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We let them sweat for a while, then we give them helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.96,1:44:33.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right up the ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.76,1:44:37.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Agent Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.36,1:44:38.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.83,1:44:42.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want that air support ready to lift off in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.20,1:44:45.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn right. Fully armed. We're on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.61,1:44:53.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.21,1:44:57.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish to talk to the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.22,1:45:02.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Special Agent Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.42,1:45:06.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The State Department has arranged for the return of your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.99,1:45:09.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Helicopters are en route as you requested.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.69,1:45:11.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I hear you. We'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.03,1:45:14.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When he figures out what hit him, he'll be in a body bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.27,1:45:18.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When they touch down, we'll blow the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.24,1:45:23.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,By the time they figure it all out, we'll be sitting on a beach earning 20%.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.46,1:45:30.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.07,1:45:32.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Powell?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.93,1:45:34.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Powell, you got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.50,1:45:38.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.94,1:45:43.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, I'm starting to get a bad feeling up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.55,1:45:45.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.38,1:45:52.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to find my wife. Don't ask me how. By then you'll know how.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.42,1:45:59.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to tell her something. I want you to tell her that...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.00,1:46:08.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her it took me a while to figure out
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.74,1:46:10.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,what ajerk I've been
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.41,1:46:12.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.34,1:46:15.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.21,1:46:21.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that when things started to pan out for her
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.02,1:46:26.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I shoulda... been more supportive.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.52,1:46:27.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.92,1:46:32.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I just should have been behind her more.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.60,1:46:35.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.53,1:46:40.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her that...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.54,1:46:46.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that she's the best thing that ever happened to a bum like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.04,1:46:51.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She's heard me say "I love you" a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.65,1:46:56.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She never heard me say "I'm sorry".
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.68,1:47:02.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to tell her that, Al. Tell her that John said that he was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.29,1:47:05.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.29,1:47:07.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got that, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.56,1:47:09.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I got it, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.17,1:47:13.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But you can tell her that yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.07,1:47:18.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You just watch your ass and you'll make it out. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.24,1:47:20.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that's up to the man upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.01,1:47:25.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.31,1:47:27.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.25,1:47:31.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck were you doing upstairs, Hans?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.42,1:47:34.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.52,1:47:37.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Al, listen. Just lay off for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.66,1:47:42.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta go check on something.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:47.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One minute, that's all I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.80,1:47:49.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One minute to speak to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.74,1:47:51.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Get back. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.87,1:47:54.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.34,1:47:58.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You let me in right now, or I call the INS, comprende?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.12,1:48:06.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the last time these kids are gonna have to speak to their parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.32,1:48:08.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.76,1:48:10.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.04,1:48:22.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What were you doin', Hans?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.17,1:48:24.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What were you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.26,1:48:50.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus, Mary, mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.87,1:48:56.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Al, listen to me! It's a double cross!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.57,1:48:58.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The roof is wired to...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.91,1:49:01.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.35,1:49:05.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.21,1:49:07.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John, come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.12,1:49:09.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.22,1:49:12.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Something about a double cross.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.32,1:49:14.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.33,1:49:22.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We are both professionals.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.70,1:49:26.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.09,1:49:52.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're comin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.93,1:49:54.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Choppers are comin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.86,1:49:58.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Time to gather your flock, Miss Gennero.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.33,1:50:02.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom and dad are very important people.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.47,1:50:04.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're very brave people.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.54,1:50:08.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something you'd like to say to them, if they're watching?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.54,1:50:11.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.19,1:50:21.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mrs McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.76,1:50:28.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How nice to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.33,1:50:33.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,On your feet, everyone! To the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.40,1:50:36.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lock them up there and come right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.87,1:51:09.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You should have heard your brother squeal... when I broke his fucking neck!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.57,1:51:14.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you figure the breakage?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.01,1:51:20.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I figure we take out the terrorists, lose 20, 25% of the hostages, tops.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.02,1:51:23.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can live with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.55,1:51:25.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get this thing on the deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.42,1:51:28.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're expecting transports, not gun ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.47,1:51:42.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move it! Come on! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.40,1:51:43.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.04,1:51:45.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.51,1:51:47.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.65,1:51:52.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Theo.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.11,1:51:54.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A little bonus for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.82,1:51:56.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, sit down. Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.88,1:51:59.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A policeman's wife might come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.69,1:52:02.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, I have some news for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.22,1:52:04.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.00,1:52:17.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.94,1:52:20.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.55,1:52:35.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Motherfucker! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.76,1:52:40.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.30,1:52:43.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- The truck? - The truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.54,1:52:54.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,After all your posturing, all your little speeches,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.68,1:52:57.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you're nothing but a common thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.25,1:52:59.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I am an exceptional thief, Mrs McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.85,1:53:04.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And since I'm moving up to kidnapping, you should be more polite.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.59,1:53:12.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You motherfucker, I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.79,1:53:16.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna fuckin' cook you, and I'm gonna fuckin' eat you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.89,1:53:40.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.60,1:53:54.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like fucking Saigon, eh, Slick?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.14,1:53:59.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was in junior high, dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.93,1:54:28.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Holly?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.44,1:54:29.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Holly Gennero?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.00,1:54:32.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly Gennero? Where's Holly?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.21,1:54:34.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Holly? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.14,1:54:35.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- They took her! - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.48,1:54:36.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The vault!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.64,1:54:38.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Where is the vault? - The 30th floor!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.98,1:54:40.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They just took her!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.08,1:54:43.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.28,1:54:46.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The whole fucking roof is wired to blow! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.59,1:54:49.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get down! Get the fuck downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.36,1:54:54.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They made us, Bureau. You got a terrorist shooting hostages.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.30,1:54:56.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I see him! Break left!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.27,1:55:03.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nail that sucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.08,1:55:15.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on your side, you assholes!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.22,1:55:18.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Swing around again! I'll bag this little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.24,1:55:39.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.04,1:55:43.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, John, what the fuck are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.01,1:55:46.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How the fuck did you get into this shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.89,1:56:00.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somethin' wrong! They're comin' back down!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.39,1:56:02.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Blow the roof. - But Karl's up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.66,1:56:04.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blow the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.34,1:56:10.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise I will never even think
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.30,1:56:13.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,about going up in a tall building again.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.61,1:56:18.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God, please don't let me die!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.60,1:57:53.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holy Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.28,1:57:56.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna need some more FBI guys, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.66,1:58:11.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus fucking Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.92,1:58:40.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.36,1:58:47.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do? Sit here while the building falls down?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.30,1:58:55.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.27,1:58:57.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.57,1:58:59.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.74,1:59:02.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.64,1:59:04.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.28,1:59:06.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.43,1:59:53.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hans!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.64,2:00:09.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.51,2:00:12.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.80,2:00:37.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's what this is all about? A fuckin' robbery?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.24,2:00:39.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put down the gun.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.14,2:00:43.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why'd you have to nuke the whole building?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.54,2:00:46.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, when you steal $600, you can just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.65,2:00:49.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When you steal 600 million, they will find you
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.75,2:00:52.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,unless they think you're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.09,2:00:54.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put down the gun.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.70,2:01:06.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.64,2:01:11.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.57,2:01:14.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Still the cowboy, Mr McClane.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.44,2:01:16.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Americans... all alike.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.18,2:01:20.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This time, John Wayne does not walk off into the sunset with Grace Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.21,2:01:22.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That was Gary Cooper, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.12,2:01:23.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough jokes.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.02,2:01:26.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd have made a pretty good cowboy yourself, Hans.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.99,2:01:31.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes. What was it you said to me before?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.73,2:01:35.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yippee-ki-yay, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.65,2:01:57.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.22,2:02:04.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy trails, Hans.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.40,2:02:51.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that's not a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.34,2:03:29.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here. It's a better angle.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.98,2:03:31.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.65,2:03:36.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it going, now. Keep it going.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.76,2:03:45.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Come on. We're going to miss it! - OK. Hand me my notes!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.38,2:04:12.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What was it like in there? How did they treat you?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.70,2:05:00.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Al, this is my wife Holly.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.50,2:05:02.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly Gennero.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.20,2:05:04.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly McClane.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.04,2:05:06.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.81,2:05:08.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got yourself a good man.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.84,2:05:10.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You take good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.48,2:05:12.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.25,2:05:15.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, I want a debriefing!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.88,2:05:18.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got some things to answer for, mister.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.65,2:05:20.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellis' murder, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.45,2:05:24.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Property damage, interfering with police business.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.56,2:06:07.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Two of you go inside and see if there's anybody else!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.41,2:06:21.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. This one's with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.96,2:06:32.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr McClane, Mr McClane!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.63,2:06:37.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that it's all over, after this incredible ordeal, what are your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.50,2:06:43.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.01,2:06:48.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Merry Christmas, Argyle. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.81,2:06:52.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.42,2:06:58.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If this is their idea of Christmas, I gotta be here for New Year's.
